rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "If you name a card that has both a mana ability and another activated ability, the mana ability can be activated but the other ability can\'t be activated."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "Pithing Needle affects cards regardless of what zone they\'re in. This includes cards in hand, cards in the graveyard, and exiled cards. For example, a player can\'t cycle Eternal Dragon or return an Eternal Dragon from their graveyard to hand if Pithing Needle naming Eternal Dragon is on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2005-06-01\', \'text\': "You can name any card, even if that card doesn\'t normally have an activated ability. You can\'t name a token unless that token has the same name as a card."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Once Pithing Needle has left the battlefield, activated abilities of sources with the chosen name can be activated again.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities include a colon and are written in the form "[cost]: [effect]." Triggered abilities and static abilities of the named card work normally.\'}]', "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'A player may bid more life than they have.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Bidding continues until all players except the one with the current high bid have declined to top that bid.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'A player who controls no permanents doesn’t need to pay 2 life (although that player can choose to do so).'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'A player with less than 2 life can’t pay 2 life and must return a permanent.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The choice of which permanent to return or whether to pay life is made as the triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Activating Tomb of Urami’s second ability requires sacrificing all lands you control, including Tomb of Urami.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'After the opponent chooses a number, Choice of Damnations’ controller may choose to make that opponent either lose that much life or make that opponent sacrifice permanents.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If the opponent must sacrifice all but a number of permanents, that opponent chooses that many permanents and then sacrifices the rest. If the number chosen is greater than the number of permanents the opponent controls, the player sacrifices nothing.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Akuta must already be in your graveyard as your upkeep begins in order for its ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'In multiplayer games, it checks for each opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'All +1/+1 counters on Descendant of Masumaro are removed, including those put on it by other effects.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Descendant of Masumaro’s printed power and toughness is 1/1, so removing all the +1/+1 counters usually doesn’t reduce the creature’s toughness to 0.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The counters are added and then removed without a pause for priority or state-based actions being checked in between.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'An attacking unblocked creature exists from the time the defending player chooses not to block that creature until the combat phase ends. Curtain of Light doesn’t have any legal targets outside of the combat phase.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Curtain of Light does trigger bushido abilities.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Curtain of Light isn’t particularly effective against creatures with trample. Since the creature with trample has no blocker to assign damage to, all the damage will be assigned to the defending player.'}, {'date': '2013-09-20', 'text': 'If a turn has multiple combat phases, this spell can be cast during any of them as long as it’s after the beginning of that phase’s Declare Blockers Step.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Burning-Eye Zubera’s ability counts all damage dealt to it this turn, from all sources.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Changing the number of cards in any player’s hand can cause Descendant of Kiyomaro to lose the life-gain triggered ability. Once an ability triggers, however, it exists independently of its source.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If any opponent has more cards or as many cards in hand as Descendant of Kiyomaro’s controller, Descendant of Kiyomaro doesn’t get any bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Creature tokens are put onto the battlefield even if there are no more +1/+1 counters to remove. For example, attempting to deal 9 damage to Sekki causes its replacement effect to 1) prevent the 9 damage, 2) remove all eight of the +1/+1 counters, and 3) put nine Spirit creature tokens onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Damage that can’t be prevented still causes counters to be removed from Sekki and puts creature tokens onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Increasing Sekki’s toughness with a card like Indomitable Will allows Sekki to prevent damage and make tokens even it if has no +1/+1 counters to be removed.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any eight Spirits to pay for Sekki’s activated ability, not just the Spirit creature tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Creatures put into graveyards after the end-of-turn step begins have no particular effect on Kuon.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Each Ascendant is legendary in both its unflipped and flipped forms. This means that effects that look for legendary creature cards, such as Time of Need and Captain Sisay, can find an Ascendant.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Kuon’s flip ability looks at everything that happened during that turn, even before Kuon entered the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Discarding Pure Intentions to your own spell or ability doesn’t trigger its abilities.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes a player to discard multiple cards, such as Waking Nightmare or Three Tragedies, Pure Intentions doesn’t return to hand until its triggered ability has resolved. A player can’t discard the same Pure Intentions twice for the same discard effect.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Neither part cares who decides which card to discard — only the controller of the spell or ability matters.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The first part of Pure Intentions is the effect of casting Pure Intentions. The second part is a triggered ability that triggers whenever an opponent’s spell or ability causes a player to discard Pure Intentions.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Each Ascendant is legendary in both its unflipped and flipped forms. This means that effects that look for legendary creature cards, such as Time of Need and Captain Sisay, can find an Ascendant.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Erayo’s Essence triggers only for the first spell an opponent casts in a given turn. It doesn’t trigger off any other spell that player casts after the first.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If Erayo, Soratami Ascendant flips while an opponent’s first spell for the turn is still on the stack, the ability of Erayo’s Essence doesn’t trigger because the opponent’s spell has already been cast. The spell isn’t countered.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If you have multiple opponents, Erayo’s Essence can trigger once for each opponent.'}, {'date': '2015-01-19', 'text': 'Erayo, Soratami Ascendant is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Each Ascendant is legendary in both its unflipped and flipped forms. This means that effects that look for legendary creature cards, such as Time of Need and Captain Sisay, can find an Ascendant.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If Sasaya’s Essence’s controller has four Forests and taps one of them for {G}, the Essence will add {G}{G}{G} to that player’s mana pool for a total of {G}{G}{G}{G}.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If Sasaya’s Essence’s controller has four Mossfire Valley and taps one of them for {R}{G}, the Essence will add three mana (one for each other Mossfire Valley) of any combination of {R} and/or {G} to that player’s mana pool.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If Sasaya’s Essence’s controller has two Brushlands and taps one of them for {W}, Sasaya’s Essence adds another {W} to that player’s mana pool. It won’t produce {G} or {C} unless the land was tapped for {G} or {C} instead.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Sasaya’s Essence has a triggered mana ability. Like activated mana abilities, the triggered mana ability doesn’t use the stack.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The triggered mana ability counts the number of other lands with that same name and adds that much mana to the player’s mana pool. The type (that is, the color of mana or colorless mana) is the same as the mana the land just produced.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'You don’t need to have seven lands in hand to reveal your hand. You leave your hand revealed until the ability resolves. If you don’t have seven or more land cards in your hand at that time, the effect does nothing.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'You don’t need to tap Sasaya to use its ability, so you can activate the ability on the turn Sasaya comes under your control.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Each Ascendant is legendary in both its unflipped and flipped forms. This means that effects that look for legendary creature cards, such as Time of Need and Captain Sisay, can find an Ascendant.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Effects that put Iname onto the battlefield don’t cause its enters-the-battlefield ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Iname can target itself with the graveyard-triggered ability, but it will be exiled and the ability won’t be able to return Iname.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'You aren’t required to exile Iname. If you don’t, the target Spirit card isn’t returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'In a Commander game, you may send Iname to the Command Zone instead of exiling it during the resolution of its ability. If you do, its ability still works. Iname’s ability only requires that you attempted to exile it, not that it actually gets to the exile zone. This is similar to how destroying a creature (with, for example, Rest in Peace) doesn’t necessarily ensure that creature will end up in the graveyard; it just so happens that the action of exiling something and the exile zone both use the same word: “exile”.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'In a Commander game where this card is your commander, casting it from the Command zone does not count as casting it from your hand.'}, {'date': '2013-09-20', 'text': 'If a creature (such as Clone) enters the battlefield as a copy of this creature, the copy’s “enters-the-battlefield” ability will still trigger as long as you cast that creature spell from your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Evermind is a blue Arcane instant card. Cards that check whether a card has any of those attributes will affect Evermind. For example, you can exile it (as a blue card) to pay the alternative costs of spells like Force of Will and Disrupting Shoal (X = 0). You could search for it with Mystical Tutor because it’s an instant or Eerie Procession because it’s an Arcane spell.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Evermind is blue in all zones.'}, {'date': '2006-10-15', 'text': 'Evermind has no mana cost, which means it can’t normally be cast as a spell. You could, however, cast it via some alternate means, like with Sunforger or Kaho, Minamo Historian.'}, {'date': '2006-10-15', 'text': 'If a spell or effect, such as Parallectric Feedback, asks for Evermind’s converted mana cost, it’s 0.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A card with a splice ability can’t be spliced onto itself because the spell is on the stack (and not in your hand) when you reveal the cards you want to splice onto it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Although originally printed with a characteristic-defining ability that defined its color, this card now has a color indicator. This color indicator can’t be affected by text-changing effects (such as the one created by Crystal Spray), although color-changing effects can still overwrite it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You choose all targets for the spell after revealing cards you want to splice, including any targets required by the text of any of those cards. You may choose a different target for each instance of the word “target” on the resulting spell.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell.'}, {'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'This has no mana cost, which means its mana cost can’t be paid for effects such as replicate from Djinn Illuminatus or flashback from Snapcaster Mage.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If Shape Stealer’s new toughness is less than any damage on Shape Stealer, Shape Stealer will be destroyed as a state-based action once the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If the other creature has bushido, whether Shape Stealer gets the bushido bonus depends on whose turn it is. If Shape Stealer is blocking, it won’t get the attacker’s bushido bonus. If the Shape Stealer is being blocked, the bushido ability will resolve just before Shape Stealer determines what the creature’s power and toughness are.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Once the ability resolves, changing the other creature’s power or toughness doesn’t affect Shape Stealer.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The other creature’s power and toughness are determined as the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers once for each creature blocked by or blocking Shape Stealer. If multiple creatures block it, Shape Stealer’s power and toughness will change for each one in succession. The first trigger put on the stack will be the last to resolve, so that will set Shape Stealer’s final power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You apply power/toughness changing effects in a series of sublayers in the following order: (a) effects from characteristic-defining abilities; (b) effects that set power and/or toughness to a specific number or value; (c) effects that modify power and/or toughness but don’t set power and/or toughness to a specific number or value; (d) changes from counters; (e) effects that switch a creature’s power and toughness. This card’s effect is always applied in (b), which means that effects applied in sublayer (c), (d), or (e) will not be overwritten; they will be applied to the new value.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If Spirit is the chosen creature type, the soulshift ability will be able to target any creature card in your graveyard of the appropriate mana value. Suppose two creatures, including one with soulshift, are put into your graveyard from the battlefield at the same time. The Spirit creature type is added as the cards enter the graveyard, just before you choose the target for the soulshift ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect takes a card Kaho exiled out of the Exile zone, then you can’t use Kaho’s ability to cast that card.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Kaho, that player may cast any of the cards exiled with Kaho’s ability.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Kaho’s activated ability refers only to cards exiled by its triggered ability. If another effect exiled the cards, you won’t be able to use Kaho to cast those cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If multiple players are tied for the most cards in hand, either when Sokenzan Renegade’s ability triggers or as it resolves, the ability does nothing.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If one of the targeted lands isn’t a legal target as Shifting Borders resolves (say, because it has left the battlefield or become untargetable), the exchange doesn’t occur.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A card with a splice ability can’t be spliced onto itself because the spell is on the stack (and not in your hand) when you reveal the cards you want to splice onto it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You choose all targets for the spell after revealing cards you want to splice, including any targets required by the text of any of those cards. You may choose a different target for each instance of the word “target” on the resulting spell.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If the Spirit or Arcane spell has {X} in the mana cost, then you use the value of {X} on the stack. For example, Shining Shoal costs {X}{W}{W}. If you choose X = 2, then Shining Shoal’s converted mana cost is 4. Shining Shoal also has an ability that says “You may exile a white card with converted mana cost X from your hand rather than pay Shining Shoal’s mana cost”; if you choose to pay the alternative cost and exile a card with converted mana cost 2, then X is 2 while Shining Shoal is on the stack and its converted mana cost is 4.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If the Spirit or Arcane spell has {X} in the mana cost, then you use the value of {X} on the stack. For example, Shining Shoal costs {X}{W}{W}. If you choose X = 2, then Shining Shoal’s mana value is 4. Shining Shoal also has an ability that says “You may exile a white card with mana value X from your hand rather than pay Shining Shoal’s mana cost”; if you choose to pay the alternative cost and exile a card with mana value 2, then X is 2 while Shining Shoal is on the stack and its mana value is 4.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If there are no other creatures on the battlefield as Kiri-Onna enters the battlefield, you must target Kiri-Onna with its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If there is no creature on the battlefield or if you don’t choose a creature as Sakashima enters the battlefield, Sakashima remains a 3/1 Human Rogue.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Sakashima doesn’t get the return to hand ability unless a creature is copied as Sakashima enters the battlefield. Sakashima can’t copy itself because the choice is made as part of the event that puts it onto the battlefield, and whatever will be copied must already be on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Sakashima must be on the battlefield at the end of turn in order to return to hand. If Sakashima leaves the battlefield after the ability is activated but before the at-end-of-turn ability resolves, the ability does nothing.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If you don’t have three or more cards in hand at the end of turn, you discard what cards you have.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If you have no cards in your library, Undying Flames does nothing.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'If you have seven or more cards in hand when Kiyomaro’s triggered ability goes on the stack but less than seven when the ability resolves, the ability does nothing.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Kiyomaro’s power and toughness don’t affect whether it has vigilance or the life-gain ability.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Losing vigilance after attackers are declared doesn’t cause Kiyomaro to tap.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Lands aren’t spells.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Legendary spells are spells of any type that have the supertype legendary.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Nonland legendary permanents don’t affect whether Ayumi can be blocked or not, only legendary lands.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Once the at-end-of-turn ability triggers, it affects the player who controlled Measure of Wickedness at that time. If Measure of Wickedness is under a different player’s control as its at-end-of-turn ability resolves, however, Measure of Wickedness stays on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'One permanent is sacrificed each time an opponent’s source deals damage to Michiko Konda’s controller. The amount of damage doesn’t matter.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Sources that deal damage multiple times (such as creatures with double strike) will trigger Michiko Konda multiple times.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Spells that deal damage repeatedly trigger Michiko Konda’s ability each time they deal damage. For example, a Glacial Ray spliced onto another Glacial Ray triggers the ability twice (once for each “2 damage” event from the Glacial Ray).'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Only the targeted land is affected.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The land’s name as well as any supertype it might have (such as legendary) remains unchanged.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Rushing-Tide Zubera’s ability counts all damage dealt to it this turn, from all sources.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Since the player’s life total is checked only as the spell resolves, you can cast Hidetsugu’s Second Rite targeting any player, regardless of life total. If the player isn’t at 10 life as Hidetsugu’s Second Rite begins resolving, it does nothing and finishes resolving. Note that since having 10 life is not a targeting restriction, the spell won’t actually be countered for having an illegal target; it just won’t do anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The X will usually include the land returned to pay the ability’s cost.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The errata makes the ability temporary. As printed, the effect didn’t end.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The additional draw triggers just after the normal draw for the turn happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The lands are returned on resolution; this is not a cost of casting the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Twincast copies any text spliced onto the targeted spell, but you can’t splice additional text onto the copy.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs paid for the targeted spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'As Twincast resolves, it creates a copy of a spell. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the copy says that it affects “you,” it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an “opponent,” it affects an opponent of the copy’s controller, not an opponent of the original spell’s controller.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the spell Twincast copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the spell Twincast copies is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Twincast can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn’t matter who controls it.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Yes, Soulshift 7. Promised Kannushi can return any Spirit with converted mana cost of 7 or less. However, Promised Kannushi is a Human Druid, not a Spirit.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'You choose how the damage will be divided among the target creatures at the time you cast Hail of Arrows. Each target must be dealt at least 1 damage. If any of those creatures becomes an illegal target before Hail of Arrows resolves, the division of damage among the remaining creatures doesn’t change.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'You choose the mode on announcement.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A creature with reach can still block creatures with flying as well as creatures without flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify a player’s hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Cursed Rack (an artifact that sets a chosen player’s maximum hand size to four) onto the battlefield choosing your opponent and then put Gnat Miser onto the battlefield, your opponent will have a maximum hand size of three. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your opponent’s maximum hand size would be four.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify a player’s hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Cursed Rack (an artifact that sets a chosen player’s maximum hand size to four) onto the battlefield choosing your opponent and then put Locust Miser onto the battlefield, your opponent will have a maximum hand size of two. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your opponent’s maximum hand size would be four.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Trusted Advisor onto the battlefield, your maximum hand size will be four. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Minamo Scrollkeeper onto the battlefield, your maximum hand size will be three. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A card with a splice ability can’t be spliced onto itself because the spell is on the stack (and not in your hand) when you reveal the cards you want to splice onto it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You choose all targets for the spell after revealing cards you want to splice, including any targets required by the text of any of those cards. You may choose a different target for each instance of the word “target” on the resulting spell.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'The ability that returns a creature doesn’t target anything. You can return a creature with shroud or protection from green, for example. You don’t decide which creature to return until the ability resolves. If you control no other green creatures, you must return Stampeding Serow itself.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'You choose a creature and return it all during resolution of the triggered ability. This means that if you control two of these, there is no way to end up returning only one creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can’t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Promise of Bunrei\'s ability will trigger multiple times if multiple creatures die at once, but it will only be sacrificed once. You\'ll get only four Spirit tokens."}]', "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'Only the player who controls Freed from the Real can activate its abilities. This might not be the controller of the enchanted creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "O-Naginata becomes unattached if the equipped creature\'s power is reduced so that its power is 2 or less, including the +3/+0 from O-Naginata\'s effect, as state-based actions are checked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "O-Naginata can become attached to a creature only if that creature\'s power is 3 or greater before O-Naginata is attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "O-Naginata\'s equip ability can target any creature you control—but if the creature\'s power is 2 or less, it won\'t become attached as it resolves."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Ab in den Kampf\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl greift in diesem Zug an, falls möglich.\\nArkane Kopplung {R} (Sowie du einen arkanen Zauberspruch spielst, kannst du diese Karte aus deiner Hand vorzeigen und ihre Kopplungskosten bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, füge dem Zauberspruch den Effekt dieser Karte hinzu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber - Arkan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105278&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a0c800-915a-4831-8497-bda07c2147e4\', \'multiverseId\': 105278}, \'multiverseid\': 105278}, {\'name\': \'A la batalla\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo ataca este turno si puede.\\nEmpalmar con lo arcano {R} (En cuanto juegues un hechizo arcano, puedes mostrar esta carta de tu mano y pagar su coste de empalme. Si lo haces, agrega los efectos de esta carta a ese hechizo).\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d1c7c7b-3ec7-4c65-b68a-e0246c03ca0c\', \'multiverseId\': 105938}, \'multiverseid\': 105938}, {\'name\': \'Entrée en lice\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée attaque ce tour-ci si possible.\\nImprégnation d\'arcane {R} (Au moment où vous jouez un sort d\'arcane, vous pouvez révéler cette carte depuis votre main et payer son coût d\'imprégnation. Si vous le faites, ajoutez les effets de cette carte à ce sort.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère : arcane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105113&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fca19d7-d21f-4768-ac46-a6d7254b1288\', \'multiverseId\': 105113}, \'multiverseid\': 105113}, {\'name\': \'Nella Mischia\', \'text\': "La creatura bersaglio attacca in questo turno se può farlo.\\nUnire nell\'Arcano {R} (Mentre giochi una magia Arcano, puoi rivelare questa carta dalla tua mano e pagare il suo costo di unione. Se lo fai, aggiungi l\'effetto di questa carta a quella magia.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e886d77a-b927-4a2e-bec8-f124d69941a3\', \'multiverseId\': 105443}, \'multiverseid\': 105443}, {\'name\': \'騒乱への突入\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは可能なら攻撃に参加する。\\n連繋（秘儀） {R}（あなたが秘儀呪文をプレイするに際し、あなたはこのカードを手札から公開して、連繋コストを支払ってもよい。 そうした場合、このカードの効果をその呪文に加える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5bf7f8-2601-49a9-8e88-163802471e18\', \'multiverseId\': 105608}, \'multiverseid\': 105608}, {\'name\': \'Dentro da Luta\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo ataca neste turno se estiver apta.\\nUnir em Arcana {R} (Conforme jogar uma mágica Arcana, você pode revelar este card de sua mão e pagar o seu custo de união. Se o fizer, adicione os efeitos deste card àquela mágica.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea - Arcana\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'478cce27-c13d-4c04-866a-07ff0343bb01\', \'multiverseId\': 105773}, \'multiverseid\': 105773}, {\'name\': \'投身战场\', \'text\': \'目标生物本回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n通联古咒{R}（于你使用古咒咒语时，你可以从你手上展示此牌，并支付其通联费用。 若你如此作，则将此牌的效应加入该咒语中。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间～古咒\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'842765bd-28aa-4fea-ac9b-0397a9b0bbc7\', \'multiverseId\': 104948}, \'multiverseid\': 104948}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abkömmling Kiyomaros\', \'text\': \'Solange du mehr Karten als jeder Gegner auf der Hand hast, erhält der Abkömmling Kiyomaros +1/+2 und hat „Immer wenn diese Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Blut von Kiyomaro fließt in meinen Adern. Unter ihm fiel Eiganjo nicht, und unter mir auch nicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105238&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f61e78b-5c0c-41c6-ad80-4207af53211d\', \'multiverseId\': 105238}, \'multiverseid\': 105238}, {\'name\': \'Descendiente de Kiyomaro\', \'text\': \'Mientras tengas más cartas en tu mano que cada oponente, el Descendiente de Kiyomaro obtiene +1/+2 y tiene "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate, ganas 3 vidas."\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La sangre de Kiyomaro corre por mis venas. Él no dejó caer a Eiganjo y tampoco lo haré yo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ee95f10-0ca7-4824-9989-db6563cb13d2\', \'multiverseId\': 105898}, \'multiverseid\': 105898}, {\'name\': \'Descendant de Kiyomaro\', \'text\': \'Tant que vous avez plus de cartes en main que chaque adversaire, le Descendant de Kiyomaro gagne +1/+2 et a « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat, vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Le sang de Kiyomaro coule dans mes veines. Jamais il n\'a laissé Eiganjo tomber face à l\'ennemi, et je ne le ferai pas non plus. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105073&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6161425-d81a-4f31-be61-f405e7bdfd88\', \'multiverseId\': 105073}, \'multiverseid\': 105073}, {\'name\': \'Discendente di Kiyomaro\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che hai in mano più carte di ogni avversario, il Discendente di Kiyomaro prende +1/+2 e ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento, guadagni 3 punti vita."\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nelle mie vene scorre il sangue di Kiyomaro. Non permise la caduta di Eiganjo e io farò lo stesso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b0fa653-3d6a-420c-8ae6-3030d47d862c\', \'multiverseId\': 105403}, \'multiverseid\': 105403}, {\'name\': \'清麻呂の末裔\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札のカードの枚数が各対戦相手よりも多いかぎり、清麻呂の末裔は＋１/＋２の修整を受けるとともに「このクリーチャーが戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは３点のライフを得る。」の能力を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'清麻呂の血が我が身体の中を流れておる。 彼が永岩城を守らんとするなら、我もまた然り。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'117a064c-dbc0-4872-9f47-a0b1f1694867\', \'multiverseId\': 105568}, \'multiverseid\': 105568}, {\'name\': \'Descendente de Kiyomaro\', \'text\': \'Desde que você tenha mais cards em sua mão do que cada oponente, Descendente de Kiyomaro recebe +1/+2 e tem "Toda vez que esta criatura causar dano de combate, você ganha 3 pontos de vida."\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Soldado Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"O sangue de Kiyomaro corre em minhas veias. Ele não deixou Eiganjo tombar e eu também não deixarei."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc123ee3-adbd-481f-ba87-778afdc9a23b\', \'multiverseId\': 105733}, \'multiverseid\': 105733}, {\'name\': \'清麻吕后裔\', \'text\': \'只要你的手牌比每位对手都多，清麻吕后裔便得+1/+2并具有「每当此生物造成战斗伤害时，你获得3点生命。」\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「清麻吕的血流窜于我体内。 他不愿让永岩城陷落，而我必遵从其意。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeaf9c21-53c7-42a3-927e-a499fce108c7\', \'multiverseId\': 104908}, \'multiverseid\': 104908}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abkömmling Masumaros\', \'text\': \'Lege zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments für jede Karte auf deiner Hand eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Abkömmling Masumaros und entferne dann eine +1/+1-Marke vom Abkömmling Masumaros für jede Karte auf der Hand eines Gegners deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105239&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3ff6b3d-ca4c-4b46-88fb-09a6d0281cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 105239}, \'multiverseid\': 105239}, {\'name\': \'Descendiente de Masumaro\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Descendiente de Masumaro por cada carta en tu mano, luego remueve un contador +1/+1 del Descendiente de Masumaro por cada carta en la mano del oponente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Monje humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99241715-dd7b-4768-925d-2b2c790cbcbc\', \'multiverseId\': 105899}, \'multiverseid\': 105899}, {\'name\': \'Descendant de Masumaro\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Descendant de Masumaro pour chaque carte dans votre main, puis retirez un marqueur +1/+1 du Descendant de Masumaro pour chaque carte dans la main de l\'adversaire ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105074&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4d76ac9-edc1-428f-9c00-dd0368065d07\', \'multiverseId\': 105074}, \'multiverseid\': 105074}, {\'name\': \'Discendente di Masumaro\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Discendente di Masumaro per ogni carta che hai in mano, quindi rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dal Discendente di Masumaro per ogni carta che l\'avversario bersaglio ha in mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura - Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2441d023-c9f8-4eaa-8c36-a24a0d50ac52\', \'multiverseId\': 105404}, \'multiverseid\': 105404}, {\'name\': \'増麻呂の末裔\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを増麻呂の末裔の上に置き、その後そのプレイヤーの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを増麻呂の末裔の上から取り除く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e66d8464-8db5-437b-8c06-d8299b467cf8\', \'multiverseId\': 105569}, \'multiverseid\': 105569}, {\'name\': \'Descendente de Masumaro\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Descendente de Masumaro para cada card em sua mão, depois remova um marcador +1/+1 de Descendente de Masumaro para cada card na mão do oponente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Monge Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e521797-b455-49de-955b-778fc8b459aa\', \'multiverseId\': 105734}, \'multiverseid\': 105734}, {\'name\': \'增麻吕后裔\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你每有一张手牌，便在增麻吕后裔上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后目标对手每有一张手牌，便从增麻吕后裔上移去一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b0c060d-5b99-4e97-9442-f7ea98bf1e71\', \'multiverseId\': 104909}, \'multiverseid\': 104909}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abkömmling Soramaros\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}: Betrachte die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek und lege sie dann in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Soramaro spricht durch mich. Lausche Dann werde ich dir von der Weisheit der Ahnen erzählen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105240&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9abc54e4-18b3-4a03-ba9b-7e9e81ac2449\', \'multiverseId\': 105240}, \'multiverseid\': 105240}, {\'name\': \'Descendiente de Soramaro\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}: Mira las primeras X cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en tu mano, luego regrésalas en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Soramaro habla a través mío. ¡Escuchen Y les transmitiré la sabiduría de los ancestros."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6193d775-ff2c-4490-b825-7404149538b2\', \'multiverseId\': 105900}, \'multiverseid\': 105900}, {\'name\': \'Descendant de Soramaro\', \'text\': "{1}{U} : Regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main, et remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est Soramaro qui parle par ma bouche. Écoutez Et je vous livrerai la sagesse des ancêtres. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105075&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'126bb71e-a344-4204-9609-5f9868d50e1f\', \'multiverseId\': 105075}, \'multiverseid\': 105075}, {\'name\': \'Discendente di Soramaro\', \'text\': "{1}{U}: Guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è pari al numero di carte che hai in mano, poi rimettile a posto nell\'ordine che preferisci.", \'type\': \'Creatura - Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Soramaro parla attraverso di me. Ascoltate E vi porterò la saggezza degli antichi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d46c0f24-455b-4040-80ab-4ed9354831f3\', \'multiverseId\': 105405}, \'multiverseid\': 105405}, {\'name\': \'空麻呂の末裔\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードを見る。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。その後、それらを好きな順番で元に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'空麻呂が我が口にて語らん。 聞け！ されば祖先の知恵を授けようぞ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9646cc18-0e10-4c4e-aac0-e0fe37a4b62d\', \'multiverseId\': 105570}, \'multiverseid\': 105570}, {\'name\': \'Descendente de Soramaro\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}: Olhe os X cards do topo de seu grimório, sendo X igual ao número de cards em sua mão, e depois coloque-os de volta em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Mago Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Soramaro fala através de mim. Escuta E eu direi a sabedoria dos ancestrais."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14905ecc-5073-4713-8ce8-c06fbefbf040\', \'multiverseId\': 105735}, \'multiverseid\': 105735}, {\'name\': \'空麻吕后裔\', \'text\': \'{1}{U}：检视你牌库顶的X张牌，X为你的手牌数量，然后将它们以任意顺序放回。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「空麻吕藉我传言。 注意听！ 我将传述先祖的智慧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65662cd0-29d8-48e5-9cc2-b059a1f3e6f8\', \'multiverseId\': 104910}, \'multiverseid\': 104910}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adamaro, als Erster begehrend\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft von Adamaro, als Erster begehrend, sind gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf der Hand des Gegners, der die meisten Karten auf der Hand hat.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur - Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Fürchtet Adamaro In ihm sind Schmerz und Zorn perfekt vereinigt."\\n—Isao, Erleuchteter Bushi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105211&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'777ffa8f-0f7c-4411-a558-fec4ba330fab\', \'multiverseId\': 105211}, \'multiverseid\': 105211}, {\'name\': \'Adamaro, el primero en desear\', \'text\': \'La fuerza y resistencia de Adamaro, el primero en desear son iguales al número de cartas en la mano del oponente con más cartas en la mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria - Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Cuidado con Adamaro En él, todo el dolor y la furia están perfeccionados."\\n—Isao, bushi inspirado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ed9746-0a7e-4a4b-b518-7850ce11e4e8\', \'multiverseId\': 105871}, \'multiverseid\': 105871}, {\'name\': \'Adamaro, premier à désirer\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance d\'Adamaro, premier à désirer sont chacune égale au nombre de cartes dans la main de l\'adversaire qui a le plus de cartes en main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Prenez garde à Adamaro Chez lui, rage et souffrance sont parfaitement harmonisées. »\\n—Isao, bushi éclairé\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5edd5537-69b1-4532-ac44-b7a0cad26019\', \'multiverseId\': 105046}, \'multiverseid\': 105046}, {\'name\': \'Adamaro, Primo a Desiderare\', \'text\': "La forza e la costituzione di Adamaro, Primo a Desiderare sono pari ciascuna al numero di carte che ha in mano l\'avversario con più carte in mano.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria - Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Guardatevi da Adamaro In lui dolore e rabbia conoscono la perfezione."\\n—Isao, Bushi Illuminato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d42e70c9-9ac5-4a00-8318-0e0fb5f66df1\', \'multiverseId\': 105376}, \'multiverseid\': 105376}, {\'name\': \'初めて欲したもの、仇麻呂\', \'text\': \'初めて欲したもの、仇麻呂のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、手札のカードの枚数が最も多い対戦相手の手札のカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'仇麻呂に気をつけよ！ すべての苦痛と憤怒は彼の中で成就されるのだ。\\n――悟りの武士、勲雄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d1f40f-41a2-4e92-97fe-fa0f46ef6578\', \'multiverseId\': 105541}, \'multiverseid\': 105541}, {\'name\': \'Adamaro, O Primeiro a Desejar\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Adamaro, O Primeiro a Desejar são ambos iguais ao número de cards da mão do oponente com mais cards na mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária - Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Tenha cuidado Adamaro Nele toda a dor e a raiva é aperfeiçoada."\\n— Isao, Bushi Iluminado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98720e22-bd28-4baf-9cc2-20270cbc796e\', \'multiverseId\': 105706}, \'multiverseid\': 105706}, {\'name\': \'始欲仇麻吕\', \'text\': \'始欲仇麻吕的力量和防御力各等同于手牌数量最多之对手的手牌数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「务必提防仇麻吕！ 他是苦痛与愤怒的精粹。」\\n～悟道武士勋雄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f14b9c39-7a29-4070-9655-27a27dddcfcd\', \'multiverseId\': 104881}, \'multiverseid\': 104881}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adamaros Blick\', \'text\': \'Adamaros Blick fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl an Karten auf seiner Hand zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber - Arkan\', \'flavor\': \'Wo auch immer er hinsah, sah er Zerstörung verursacht durch seinen Blick.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105256&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0992235e-38ae-415c-8b1e-73eb3f2c6b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 105256}, \'multiverseid\': 105256}, {\'name\': \'Mirada de Adamaro\', \'text\': \'La Mirada de Adamaro hace una cantidad de daño igual al número de cartas que haya en la mano del jugador objetivo a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'A donde fuera que mirara, veía destrucción; la estela de su propia mirada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc2b6782-6ade-40f7-9a44-531df62439db\', \'multiverseId\': 105916}, \'multiverseid\': 105916}, {\'name\': "Regard d\'Adamaro", \'text\': "Le Regard d\'Adamaro inflige au joueur ciblé un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes dans la main de ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Éphémère : arcane\', \'flavor\': "Où qu\'il regarde, il ne voyait que destruction — le sillage de son propre regard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105091&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8dec40b-e73b-4e65-9294-b749b0704e70\', \'multiverseId\': 105091}, \'multiverseid\': 105091}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo di Adamaro\', \'text\': \'Lo Sguardo di Adamaro infligge a un giocatore bersaglio un ammontare di danni pari al numero di carte che quel giocatore ha in mano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'Ovunque guardasse, vedeva distruzione: la scia del suo stesso sguardo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9014b32-7ba7-4fe7-bd42-8f8be06440de\', \'multiverseId\': 105421}, \'multiverseid\': 105421}, {\'name\': \'仇麻呂の凝視\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。仇麻呂の凝視はそのプレイヤーに、そのプレイヤーの手札のカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': \'どこであろうと、その眼差しの先には破壊があった――それは己が眼差しから起こるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'922ef13d-bd47-4279-aa38-e15d7e414f6a\', \'multiverseId\': 105586}, \'multiverseid\': 105586}, {\'name\': \'Olhar de Adamaro\', \'text\': \'Olhar de Adamaro causa ao jogador alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de cards na mão daquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea - Arcana\', \'flavor\': \'Para qualquer lugar que olhava, via destruição o rastro de sua própria mirada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39f0bdc2-a245-4a2f-920d-ca7f7fdff677\', \'multiverseId\': 105751}, \'multiverseid\': 105751}, {\'name\': \'仇麻吕的逼视\', \'text\': \'仇麻吕的逼视对目标牌手造成等同于该牌手之手牌数量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间～古咒\', \'flavor\': \'目光所及之处，尽化眼底飞灰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb5f4b4-3d59-4743-aa6f-b9ea62702320\', \'multiverseId\': 104926}, \'multiverseid\': 104926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akki-Einpauker\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Welchen Teil von \\\'hayaku ikee\\\' hast du nicht verstanden?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105213&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01b2d565-e6de-48a0-a546-ab09c0ea6bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 105213}, \'multiverseid\': 105213}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de instrucción akki\', \'text\': \'{T}: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué parte de \\\'¡hayaku ikee\\\' no entendiste?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e798b3c-3ceb-43f0-8336-607d14b63f77\', \'multiverseId\': 105873}, \'multiverseid\': 105873}, {\'name\': \'Maître-recruteur akki\', \'text\': "{T} : La créature ciblée acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que tu n\'as pas compris dans \'hayaku ikee \' ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105048&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc299e83-eff1-4188-8e86-7c56657becad\', \'multiverseId\': 105048}, \'multiverseid\': 105048}, {\'name\': \'Mastrotrivella Akki\', \'text\': \'{T}: La creatura bersaglio guadagna rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Quale parte di \\\'hayaku ikee\\\' non sei riuscito a capire?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6c403a-7499-4a96-b09c-bb92316585ff\', \'multiverseId\': 105378}, \'multiverseid\': 105378}, {\'name\': \'悪忌の教練官\', \'text\': \'{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「ハヤクイケエ！」のどの部分がわからないんだ？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8417fb8-c76a-42ed-bb2d-daa3fa4e407b\', \'multiverseId\': 105543}, \'multiverseid\': 105543}, {\'name\': \'Akki Mestre Perfurador\', \'text\': \'{T}: A criatura alvo ganha a habilidade de ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Xamã Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Qual parte de \\\'hayaku ikee\\\' você não entendeu?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847273a7-4c29-471d-8a22-820f4dd0ff53\', \'multiverseId\': 105708}, \'multiverseid\': 105708}, {\'name\': \'恶鬼持钻师\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「『哈哑苦一器』这句话，你到底是哪边听不懂？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2700305d-891f-41f7-b9c0-941430c042e4\', \'multiverseId\': 104883}, \'multiverseid\': 104883}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akki-Handlanger\', \'text\': \'Solange du sieben oder mehr Karten auf deiner Hand hast, erhält der Akki-Handlanger +2/+1 und Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe meine Hunde im Krieg verloren und musste Akki als Diener anstellen. Immerhin ist ihre Erziehung bemerkenswert ähnlich."\\n—Kensuke, Hundetrainer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105214&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b57b19-f249-461f-b566-f1fc23be58bf\', \'multiverseId\': 105214}, \'multiverseid\': 105214}, {\'name\': \'Subalterno akki\', \'text\': \'Mientras tengas siete o más cartas en tu mano, el Subalterno akki obtiene +2/+1 y tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Perdí mis sabuesos en la guerra, y tuve que contratar akki como sirvientes. Descubrí que su entrenamiento es notablemente parecido."\\n—Kensuke, adiestrador canino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7c1e17-e2c2-4447-bf4d-dc5428560706\', \'multiverseId\': 105874}, \'multiverseid\': 105874}, {\'name\': \'Sous-fifre akki\', \'text\': "Tant que vous avez au moins sept cartes en main, le Sous-fifre akki gagne +2/+1 et a l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai perdu mes chiens dans la guerre et j\'ai été obligé d\'employer des akki comme serviteurs. Les dresser m\'a paru fortement similaire. »\\n—Kensuke, maître-chien", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105049&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2527e93-6e0a-45df-b2b3-8554bda58825\', \'multiverseId\': 105049}, \'multiverseid\': 105049}, {\'name\': \'Tirapiedi Akki\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che hai almeno sette carte in mano, il Tirapiedi Akki prende +2/+1 e ha attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho perso i miei segugi nella guerra e mi sono ridotto a utilizzare gli akki come servitori. Ho scoperto che per addestrarli vanno bene gli stessi sistemi."\\n—Kensuke, signore dei segugi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea59c1d-79a5-4082-ac3f-c25e93828e48\', \'multiverseId\': 105379}, \'multiverseid\': 105379}, {\'name\': \'悪忌の手下\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札のカードの枚数が７枚以上であるかぎり、悪忌の手下は＋２/＋１の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'戦で犬を失ったので、手下に悪忌を雇う羽目になったことがある。 訓練の仕方は非常に似ておったわ。\\n――犬師の健助\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccef6378-de63-4479-bb7b-18629f4258b6\', \'multiverseId\': 105544}, \'multiverseid\': 105544}, {\'name\': \'Lacaio Akki\', \'text\': \'Desde que você tenha sete ou mais cards em sua mão, Lacaio Akki recebe +2/+1 e tem a habilidade de iniciativa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Guerreiro Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu perdi meus cães de caça na guerra e desde então tenho empregado akkis como servos. Descobri que seus treinamentos são extraordinariamente semelhantes."\\n— Kensuke, mestre dos cães de caça\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cbb8fa8-a296-4cf9-8bc3-2a84492d6d98\', \'multiverseId\': 105709}, \'multiverseid\': 105709}, {\'name\': \'恶鬼手下\', \'text\': \'只要你的手牌有七张或更多，恶鬼手下便得+2/+1并具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「自从养的狗在战争中死掉，我就开始用恶鬼当部下。 其实他们的训练法都差不多。」\\n～犬师健助\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0302d559-05f3-4800-ac3d-e9b0afc829fb\', \'multiverseId\': 104884}, \'multiverseid\': 104884}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akuta, aus Asche geboren\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nFalls du zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments mehr Karten als jeder Gegner auf der Hand hast, kannst du einen Sumpf opfern. Falls du dies tust, bringe Akuta, aus Asche geboren, aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur - Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105215&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f48e9ec-c6c7-4270-b86d-1cad196ce95b\', \'multiverseId\': 105215}, \'multiverseid\': 105215}, {\'name\': \'Akuta, nacido de la ceniza\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si tienes más cartas en tu mano que cada oponente, puedes sacrificar un pantano. Si lo haces, regresa a Akuta, nacido de la ceniza de tu cementerio al juego.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria - Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71f57397-6613-427f-8717-786e2f371201\', \'multiverseId\': 105875}, \'multiverseid\': 105875}, {\'name\': \'Akuta, né des cendres\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous avez plus de cartes en main que chaque adversaire, vous pouvez sacrifier un marais. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez en jeu Akuta, né des cendres depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105050&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755ff000-f819-4365-bd6e-e6d6fc3e999a\', \'multiverseId\': 105050}, \'multiverseid\': 105050}, {\'name\': \'Akuta, Nato dalla Cenere\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se hai in mano più carte di ogni avversario, puoi sacrificare una Palude. Se lo fai, rimetti in gioco Akuta, Nato dalla Cenere dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria - Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de9b31e1-f352-4dcd-a833-6da703d25247\', \'multiverseId\': 105380}, \'multiverseid\': 105380}, {\'name\': \'灰生まれの阿苦多\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの手札のカードの枚数が各対戦相手よりも多い場合、あなたは沼を１つ生け贄に捧げてもよい。 そうした場合、灰生まれの阿苦多をあなたの墓地から場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e2ed972-1fe8-48ad-a326-777f304b8e71\', \'multiverseId\': 105545}, \'multiverseid\': 105545}, {\'name\': \'Akuta, Nascido das Cinzas\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nNo início de sua manutenção, se você tiver mais cards em sua mão do que cada oponente, você pode sacrificar um Pântano. Se o fizer, devolva Akuta, Nascido das Cinzas de seu cemitério para o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária - Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06f366f8-6722-4c13-a014-ce57528bf8cd\', \'multiverseId\': 105710}, \'multiverseid\': 105710}, {\'name\': \'芥苏阿苦多\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n在你的维持开始时，若你的手牌比每位对手都多，你可以牺牲一个沼泽。 若你如此作，则将芥苏阿苦多从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4993187c-2eae-44d7-9e15-50d6f14b58d5\', \'multiverseId\': 104885}, \'multiverseid\': 104885}]', '[{\'name\': \'Andauerndes Ideal\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Verzauberungskarte und bringe sie ins Spiel. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\\nEpisch (Für den Rest des Spiels kannst du keine Zaubersprüche spielen. Kopiere zu Beginn jedes deiner Versorgungssegmente diesen Zauberspruch außer seiner epischen Fähigkeit.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105247&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19f8e7e-894d-4414-a75e-0c97767e2135\', \'multiverseId\': 105247}, \'multiverseid\': 105247}, {\'name\': \'Ideal perenne\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de encantamiento y ponla en juego. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\nÉpico (No puedes jugar hechizos por el resto del juego. Al comienzo de cada uno de tus mantenimientos, copia este hechizo excepto por su habilidad épica.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8533e223-8257-4a7c-bfa3-dec16e5dc647\', \'multiverseId\': 105907}, \'multiverseid\': 105907}, {\'name\': \'Idéal perpétuel\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'enchantement et mettez-la en jeu. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nÉpique(Pour le restant de la partie, vous ne pouvez pas jouer de sorts. Au début de chacun de vos entretiens, copiez ce sort à l\'exception de sa capacité d\'épique.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105082&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d50ac02-4dc2-4ff8-9afa-581e658f74ee\', \'multiverseId\': 105082}, \'multiverseid\': 105082}, {\'name\': \'Ideale Perpetuo\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli una carta incantesimo e mettila in gioco. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\nEpopea (Per il resto della partita, non puoi giocare magie. All\'inizio di ogni tuo mantenimento, copia questa magia tranne la sua abilità epopea.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'316e39b0-b88b-432d-9551-4dc2f36ae64a\', \'multiverseId\': 105412}, \'multiverseid\': 105412}, {\'name\': \'不朽の理想\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーからエンチャント･カードを１枚探し、それを場に出す。 その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n歴伝 （残りのゲームの間、あなたは呪文をプレイできない。 あなたの各アップキープの開始時に、この呪文を歴伝能力を除いてコピーする。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df8fb2ca-b623-4244-a924-304e24ca43c0\', \'multiverseId\': 105577}, \'multiverseid\': 105577}, {\'name\': \'Ideal Durador\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório por um card de encantamento e coloque-o em jogo. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\\nÉpica (Você não pode jogar mágicas pelo resto do duelo. No início de cada uma de suas manutenções, copie esta mágica menos sua habilidade épica.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723a66da-89a7-4eb3-b4e8-780ad95d1932\', \'multiverseId\': 105742}, \'multiverseid\': 105742}, {\'name\': \'不泯理念\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张结界牌并将之放置进场。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n历传（这盘游戏结束之前，你不能使用咒语。 在你每回合的维持开始时，复制此咒语，但不包含其历传异能。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73db9cb9-90cf-4846-b44b-d7d0f4b69de4\', \'multiverseId\': 104917}, \'multiverseid\': 104917}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ansturm durch die Araba\', \'text\': \'Wegfegen Bringe eine beliebige Anzahl an Ebenen, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten für jede auf diese Weise zurückgebrachte Ebene +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber - Arkan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105227&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbbefe64-3b40-48f4-8a83-7f4c56f6fef9\', \'multiverseId\': 105227}, \'multiverseid\': 105227}, {\'name\': \'Carga a través de Araba\', \'text\': \'Recolectar Regresa cualquier número de llanuras que controles a la mano de su propietario. Las criaturas que controles obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada llanura que hayas regresado de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8867b598-5862-4f3c-ac13-34b8b639e556\', \'multiverseId\': 105887}, \'multiverseid\': 105887}, {\'name\': "Charge sur l\'Araba", \'text\': "Balayage — Renvoyez n\'importe quel nombre de plaines que vous contrôlez dans la main de leur propriétaire. Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque plaine renvoyée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère : arcane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105062&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'816ef75c-c550-4b97-8db4-f61e7ebee9b8\', \'multiverseId\': 105062}, \'multiverseid\': 105062}, {\'name\': "Carica Attraverso l\'Araba", \'text\': \'Spazzar via Fai tornare in mano al proprietario un qualsiasi numero di Pianure che controlli. Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni Pianura ripresa in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'160192d2-b3ee-4402-a2ee-b5b9a5ad87c5\', \'multiverseId\': 105392}, \'multiverseid\': 105392}, {\'name\': \'荒場越えの突撃\', \'text\': \'掃引――あなたがコントロールする平地を望む数だけオーナーの手札に戻す。 あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、これにより戻された平地１つにつきターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0cf67f6-7aaf-4a6c-af89-1263014575bc\', \'multiverseId\': 105557}, \'multiverseid\': 105557}, {\'name\': \'Carga Através de Araba\', \'text\': \'Varredura Devolve qualquer número de Planícies que você controla para a mão de seu dono. As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada Planície devolvida dessa maneira.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea - Arcana\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b0dcef-0012-4307-b699-66163b188781\', \'multiverseId\': 105722}, \'multiverseid\': 105722}, {\'name\': \'冲越荒场\', \'text\': \'扫平～将任意数量由你操控的平原移回其拥有者手上。 每以此法移回一个平原，由你操控的生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间～古咒\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b65bbf3e-61b5-42ca-8351-5e8f0e7dbb42\', \'multiverseId\': 104897}, \'multiverseid\': 104897}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anwesenheit der Weisen\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte für jede Karte auf deiner Hand dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Bescheiden verbeuge ich mich. Leise warte ich. Genau höre ich zu."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105329&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d7104b-4e70-4147-8d1e-040114d5b0d3\', \'multiverseId\': 105329}, \'multiverseid\': 105329}, {\'name\': \'Presencia de los sabios\', \'text\': \'Gana 2 vidas por cada carta que haya en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Humildemente me inclino. Silenciosamente espero. Profundamente escucho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f0f64a-7a9d-4366-9e7f-5af6a48e6df1\', \'multiverseId\': 105989}, \'multiverseid\': 105989}, {\'name\': \'Présence du sage\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 2 points de vie pour chaque carte dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Humble, je me prosterne. Silencieux, j\'attends. Concentré, j\'écoute. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc5cfb4-84b6-456e-860b-b5087c6c1f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 105164}, \'multiverseid\': 105164}, {\'name\': \'Presenza del Saggio\', \'text\': \'Guadagni 2 punti vita per ogni carta che hai in mano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi chino umilmente. Attendo in silenzio. Ascolto attentamente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ed4ac9e-60a3-41a6-882a-d3b2d6910bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 105494}, \'multiverseid\': 105494}, {\'name\': \'知者の存在\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたの手札のカード１枚につき２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'厳かに頭を垂る。 静かに時を待つ。 只管に声を聞く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862622ac-1b07-49b6-bb5a-7fb0730d961d\', \'multiverseId\': 105659}, \'multiverseid\': 105659}, {\'name\': \'Presença do Sábio\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 2 pontos de vida para cada card em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Humildemente eu me curvo. Silenciosamente eu espero. Absorto, eu escuto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9f3b1d0-20ff-4ca3-a248-1229ac7c1e11\', \'multiverseId\': 105824}, \'multiverseid\': 105824}, {\'name\': \'智者风采\', \'text\': \'你每有一张手牌，便获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「诚心敬拜， 静心等待， 全心倾听。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f30122c-b781-4954-b8f6-39f871191854\', \'multiverseId\': 104999}, \'multiverseid\': 104999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Araba-Mottenreiter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBushido 1 (Wenn diese Karte blockt oder geblockt wird, erhält sie +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Mensch, Samurai\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine besten Werke sind diejenigen, die ich den Motten von Eiganjo nachempfunden habe. Sie fliegen höher, schneller und anmutiger als alle meine eigenen Entwürfe."Noboru, Segeldrachenmeister\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105216&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b412fea4-57a2-4171-bf24-d1abe8ca142a\', \'multiverseId\': 105216}, \'multiverseid\': 105216}, {\'name\': \'Jinete de polillas de Araba\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nBushido 1 (Cuando esta criatura bloquee o sea bloqueada, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Samurái humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mis mejores creaciones son las que basé en las polillas de Eiganjo. Ellas vuelan más alto, más rápido y con más gracia que cualquiera de mis diseños."Noboru, maestro fabricante de cometas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fac5058-9eab-4920-a674-da1c0c0d8559\', \'multiverseId\': 105876}, \'multiverseid\': 105876}, {\'name\': "Chevauche-phalène d\'Araba", \'text\': "Vol\\nBushido 1 (Quand cette créature bloque ou devient bloquée, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et samouraï\', \'flavor\': "« Mes plus belles créations sont modelées sur les phalènes d\'Eiganjo. Elles volent plus haut, plus vite et avec plus de grâce que mes inventions. »Noboru, maître façonneur de cerfs-volants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85e5cd80-67b9-4fa7-9b33-3e9170bea8d3\', \'multiverseId\': 105051}, \'multiverseid\': 105051}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcafalene di Araba\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nBushido 1 (Quando questa blocca o viene bloccata, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Samurai Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le mie creazioni più riuscite sono ispirate ai lepidotteri di Eiganjo. Volano più alte, più veloci e con più grazia di qualsiasi altra mia opera."Noboru, mastro aquilonista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'762f9589-e6bc-4ea9-b327-4c00e6790cda\', \'multiverseId\': 105381}, \'multiverseid\': 105381}, {\'name\': \'荒場の蛾乗り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n武士道 1 （これがブロックに参加するかブロックされた状態になるたび、それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・侍\', \'flavor\': \'私の最高の作品は永岩城の蛾を模したものだ。 奴らは私のこれまでのどの作よりも高く、速く、優雅に飛ぶのだ。――凧作り師の昇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1738b9-5fbf-4c30-a8fb-4c6d0885008a\', \'multiverseId\': 105546}, \'multiverseid\': 105546}, {\'name\': \'Ginete de Mariposas de Araba\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nBushido 1 (Quando este bloquear ou for bloqueado, ele recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Samurai Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"As minhas melhores criações são as que fiz usando as mariposas de Eiganjo como inspiração. Elas voam mais alto, mais rápido e mais graciosamente do que qualquer um de meus próprios modelos." Noboru, mestre criador de avérneos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1523e8d-f743-4db4-82da-cb3c01bd099d\', \'multiverseId\': 105711}, \'multiverseid\': 105711}, {\'name\': \'荒场蛾骑士\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n武士道1（每当它进行阻挡或被阻挡时，它得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／武士\', \'flavor\': \'「我最引以为傲的作品是以永岩城的蛾为模板。他们比其余的飞得最高、最快，姿态也更优雅。」 ～风筝大师升\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30539b39-bbfd-4f9a-93f1-3cddce773eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 104886}, \'multiverseid\': 104886}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arashi, der Himmelsteiler\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, der Himmelsteiler fügt einer fliegenden Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\nBlutzoll {X}{G}{G}, wirf Arashi aus deiner Hand ab: Arashi fügt jeder fliegenden Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur - Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105217&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d27919d6-c244-4d73-afd7-aee015603765\', \'multiverseId\': 105217}, \'multiverseid\': 105217}, {\'name\': \'Arashi, el cielo desbaratado\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, el cielo desbaratado hace X puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\\nCanalizar {X}{G}{G}, descartar a Arashi: Arashi hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria - Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efc7cf6e-3aa3-4df4-b71c-bcd3e6543b5a\', \'multiverseId\': 105877}, \'multiverseid\': 105877}, {\'name\': \'Arashi, le ciel déchiré\', \'text\': "{X}{G}, {T} : Arashi, le ciel déchiré inflige X blessures à la créature avec le vol ciblée.\\nTransfert {X}{G}{G}, Défaussez-vous d\'Arashi, le ciel déchiré : Arashi, le ciel déchiré inflige X blessures à chaque créature avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105052&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e43cc18-1bbf-49d9-b270-98d046486f02\', \'multiverseId\': 105052}, \'multiverseid\': 105052}, {\'name\': \'Arashi, lo Squartacielo\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, lo Squartacielo infligge X danni a una creatura bersaglio con volare.\\nIncanalare {X}{G}{G}, Scarta Arashi: Arashi infligge X danni a ogni creatura con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria - Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653b50bd-c427-47f2-8ad5-24be7d1ef659\', \'multiverseId\': 105382}, \'multiverseid\': 105382}, {\'name\': \'空を引き裂くもの、閼螺示\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}：飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。空を引き裂くもの、閼螺示はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n魂力――{X}{G}{G}, 空を引き裂くもの、閼螺示を捨てる：空を引き裂くもの、唖螺示は飛行を持つ各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9435c0c-5b53-42c9-9d7a-513f818d7e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 105547}, \'multiverseid\': 105547}, {\'name\': \'Arashi, o Céu em Pedaços\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}, {T}: Arashi, o Céu em Pedaços causa X pontos de dano à criatura alvo com a habilidade de voar.\\nCanalizar {X}{G}{G}, Descarte Arashi: Arashi causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura com a habilidade de voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária - Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'554603fb-012b-46d1-8edb-109051f49e13\', \'multiverseId\': 105712}, \'multiverseid\': 105712}, {\'name\': \'烈风哑螺示\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}，{T}：烈风哑螺示对目标具飞行异能的生物造成X点伤害。\\n魂力～{X}{G}{G}，弃掉哑螺示：哑螺示对每个具飞行异能的生物各造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6976606-2058-4be2-acd1-637c63c73804\', \'multiverseId\': 104887}, \'multiverseid\': 104887}]', '[{\'name\': \'Asche der Gefallenen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp, sowie Asche der Gefallenen ins Spiel kommt.\\nJede Kreaturenkarte auf deinem Friedhof hat den bestimmten Kreaturentyp zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Asche der Toten vermischt sich mit der Erde, und beide werden zu einem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105218&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21447430-9e67-4346-8e8b-148881c824df\', \'multiverseId\': 105218}, \'multiverseid\': 105218}, {\'name\': \'Cenizas de los caídos\', \'text\': \'En cuanto Cenizas de los caídos entre en juego, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nCada carta de criatura en tu cementerio tiene el tipo de criatura elegido además de sus otros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Las cenizas de los muertos se mezclan con el suelo, y se funden en una sola cosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'035a33bd-0b53-47f3-bf1b-f6a6d1ff65fa\', \'multiverseId\': 105878}, \'multiverseid\': 105878}, {\'name\': \'Cendres des déchus\', \'text\': \'Au moment où les Cendres des déchus arrivent en jeu, choisissez un type de créature.\\nChaque carte de créature de votre cimetière a le type de créature choisi en plus de ses autres types.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les cendres des morts se mélangent à la terre et ne font plus qu\'un avec elle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105053&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8b0a30d-a574-4d6d-9638-1e188ad045d5\', \'multiverseId\': 105053}, \'multiverseid\': 105053}, {\'name\': \'Ceneri dei Caduti\', \'text\': \'Mentre le Ceneri dei Caduti entrano in gioco, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nOgni carta creatura presente nel tuo cimitero ha il tipo di creatura scelto in aggiunta ai propri altri tipi.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Le ceneri dei morti si mischiano con la terra e divengono un tutt\'uno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75dff1ee-ee2f-4f76-bc6b-96c8fdb59bb0\', \'multiverseId\': 105383}, \'multiverseid\': 105383}, {\'name\': \'堕ちたる者の灰\', \'text\': \'堕ちたる者の灰が場に出る際に、クリーチャー・タイプを１つ選ぶ。\\nあなたの墓地にある各クリーチャー・カードは、本来のタイプに加えて選ばれたクリーチャー・タイプを持つ。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'死者の灰は、泥と交じり合い一つになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba2edd38-f64a-4cef-8566-5ec160d0038f\', \'multiverseId\': 105548}, \'multiverseid\': 105548}, {\'name\': \'Cinzas dos Caídos\', \'text\': \'Conforme Cinzas dos Caídos entra em jogo, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nCada card de criatura em seu cemitério tem o tipo de criatura escolhido além de seus outros tipos.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'As cinzas dos mortos se misturam com o solo e ambos se tornam um.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d25cdee-2b9c-4d26-bfb2-ed33eb1117d2\', \'multiverseId\': 105713}, \'multiverseid\': 105713}, {\'name\': \'逝者秘尘\', \'text\': \'于逝者秘尘进场时，选择一个生物类别。\\n在你坟墓场中，且具有该生物类别的每张生物牌，都额外具有该生物类别。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'亡者骨灰混入土壤，最终合而为一。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a931a561-2258-4ec6-b8ba-757d62ec8b30\', \'multiverseId\': 104888}, \'multiverseid\': 104888}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ayumi, die letzte Besucherin\', \'text\': \'Legendäres-Land-Tarnung\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur - Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Bevor Shinkas Mauern erbaut wurden, bevor die Torii in Okina errichtet wurden: sie war da, groß und stolz vor dem weiten Himmel, und sie wird auch immer noch da sein, wenn die Bauwerke lange wieder Staub sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105219&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d12bf57a-24d9-4520-8680-15c56149356d\', \'multiverseId\': 105219}, \'multiverseid\': 105219}, {\'name\': \'Ayumi, la última visitante\', \'text\': \'Cruza tierras legendarias.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria - Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Antes de que los muros de Shinka fueran construidos, antes de que se levantara el torii de Okina, ella estaba allí, alta y orgullosa contra el cielo, y estará allí mucho después de que se hayan convertido en polvo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae318a8e-3809-4d4e-8a44-80e0907ff9ad\', \'multiverseId\': 105879}, \'multiverseid\': 105879}, {\'name\': \'Ayumi, la dernière visiteuse\', \'text\': \'Traversée des terrains légendaires\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : esprit\', \'flavor\': "Avant la construction des murs de Shinka, avant l\'érection des torii d\'Okina, elle était là, sa silhouette bloquant le ciel. Et elle sera encore là longtemps après leur destruction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105054&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daeb0c21-3f0e-4d2e-b5cf-c68a8334866c\', \'multiverseId\': 105054}, \'multiverseid\': 105054}, {\'name\': "Ayumi, l\'Ultima Presenza", \'text\': \'Passa-terre leggendarie\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria - Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Prima che venissero erette le mura di Shinka, prima che si levasse il torii di Okina, ella era lì, stagliata alta e fiera contro il cielo, dove rimarrà a lungo dopo che si saranno sgretolati in polvere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33ed16c0-5b0a-4610-88d3-d26a9d55c48f\', \'multiverseId\': 105384}, \'multiverseid\': 105384}, {\'name\': \'最後に訪れしもの、亜楡身\', \'text\': \'伝説の土地渡り\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'真火の壁が建てられる前、翁神社の鳥居の立つ前から、彼女はそこにいた。彼女は丈高く、誇りを持って空に向かい、それらが塵と化してもなおそこに居続けるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'609c936a-c090-46cf-ab9b-8b4d1030117f\', \'multiverseId\': 105549}, \'multiverseid\': 105549}, {\'name\': \'Ayumi, a Última Visitante\', \'text\': \'Travessia de Terreno Lendário\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária - Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Antes das muralhas de Shinka serem construídas, antes do torii em Okina, ela estava lá, alta e orgulhosa no céu, e estará lá muito tempo depois deles virarem pó.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1570019-973c-4f99-8fd9-4449512fcebe\', \'multiverseId\': 105714}, \'multiverseid\': 105714}, {\'name\': \'终境访客亚榆身\', \'text\': \'传奇地行者\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'远在真火的城垣、翁神社的鸟居立起之前，永存不灭的她便已傲立天地间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ea2511-84cf-47b0-89d3-1041eb724fea\', \'multiverseId\': 104889}, \'multiverseid\': 104889}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belohnung des Schmerzes\', \'text\': \'Du bietest eine beliebige Anzahl Lebenspunkte. In Zugreihenfolge kann jeder Spieler das Höchstgebot überbieten. Es wird geboten, bis keiner mehr bieten will. Der Spieler mit dem Höchstgebot verliert so viele Lebenspunkte, wie er geboten hat, und zieht vier Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105325&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2775ed3-9f18-40d7-a8ee-9f618a15eb14\', \'multiverseId\': 105325}, \'multiverseid\': 105325}, {\'name\': \'Recompensa del dolor\', \'text\': \'Ofrece cualquier cantidad de vida. En orden de turnos, cada jugador puede superar la oferta del otro. La oferta termina si no se supera la oferta mayor. Quien haga la oferta mayor pierde una cantidad de vida igual a la oferta mayor y roba cuatro cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9163417-2d12-4420-bf84-98f246528b1d\', \'multiverseId\': 105985}, \'multiverseid\': 105985}, {\'name\': \'Récompense de la souffrance\', \'text\': "Vous pariez le nombre de points de vie de votre choix. Dans l\'ordre du tour, chaque joueur peut surenchérir. L\'enchère se termine quand tous les joueurs cessent de surenchérir. Le joueur avec l\'enchère la plus élevée perd un nombre de points de vie égal à l\'enchère la plus élevée et pioche quatre cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ae44762-75ef-4b17-934e-db8d3edf5f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 105160}, \'multiverseid\': 105160}, {\'name\': \'Ricompensa del Dolore\', \'text\': "Scommetti una quantità qualsiasi di punti vita. Seguendo l\'ordine di gioco, ciascun giocatore può rilanciare. Le puntate terminano quando nessuno rilancia. Chi ha scommesso di più perde l\'ammontare di punti vita che ha puntato e pesca quattro carte.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'286d5259-db2a-4ced-bfc5-7394d868311c\', \'multiverseId\': 105490}, \'multiverseid\': 105490}, {\'name\': \'苦痛の報償\', \'text\': \'あなたはライフの点数を宣言する。 ターンの進行順に、各プレイヤーは宣言されているよりも高いライフの点数を宣言してもよい。 一番高いライフの点数が確定したら、宣言は終了する。 一番高いライフの点数を宣言したプレイヤーは、その点数に等しいライフを失い、カードを４枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d1bfaa3-696c-42fd-87b6-cf67e937cad4\', \'multiverseId\': 105655}, \'multiverseid\': 105655}, {\'name\': \'Recompensa da Dor\', \'text\': \'Você aposta qualquer quantidade de pontos de vida. Na ordem do turno, cada jogador pode aumentar o lance. A aposta termina no lance mais alto. O maior apostador perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual a aposta mais alta e compra quatro cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb81b7cd-444a-4aa8-b9c6-d2e0d4e4619d\', \'multiverseId\': 105820}, \'multiverseid\': 105820}, {\'name\': \'苦痛报偿\', \'text\': \'你以任意数量的生命来喊价。 依照回合的顺序，每位牌手可出更高的价。 如果无人出更高的价，则此喊价结束。 出最高价的牌手失去等同于其出价的生命，并抓四张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d535e0f-87f9-449d-a720-d77fa67814e3\', \'multiverseId\': 104995}, \'multiverseid\': 104995}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzaugen-Zubera\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Blitzaugen-Zubera aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird und falls ihm in diesem Zug 4 oder mehr Schadenspunkte zugefügt wurden, fügt er einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Zubera, Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105224&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14191323-2889-4888-9f4f-6f97608b4acb\', \'multiverseId\': 105224}, \'multiverseid\': 105224}, {\'name\': \'Zubera ojo ardiente\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Zubera ojo ardiente vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, si se le hicieron 4 o más puntos de daño este turno, el Zubera ojo ardiente hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espíritu zubera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca53138-0445-48df-acad-133fe619c976\', \'multiverseId\': 105884}, \'multiverseid\': 105884}, {\'name\': "Zubera à l\'œil brûlant", \'text\': "Quand le Zubera à l\'œil brûlant est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, si au moins 4 blessures lui ont été infligées ce tour-ci, le Zubera à l\'œil brûlant inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : zubera et esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105059&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a752d9b7-344d-4754-b225-98fd9c352516\', \'multiverseId\': 105059}, \'multiverseid\': 105059}, {\'name\': \'Zubera Occhio di Brace\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Zubera Occhio di Brace viene messo in un cimitero dal gioco, se gli sono stati inflitti almeno 4 danni in questo turno, esso infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Spirito Zubera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eb6972a-b8dd-4c01-ad95-2f88a008834a\', \'multiverseId\': 105389}, \'multiverseid\': 105389}, {\'name\': \'燃える眼のずべら\', \'text\': \'燃える眼のずべらが場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、このターンそれに４点以上のダメージが与えられている場合、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。燃える眼のずべらはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ずべら・スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73aa5aa2-f3b1-40c6-9398-297e05c83ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 105554}, \'multiverseid\': 105554}, {\'name\': \'Zubera Olho Flamejante\', \'text\': \'Quando Zubera Olho Flamejante é colocado num cemitério vindo de jogo, se 4 ou mais pontos de dano foram causados a ele neste turno, Zubera Olho Flamejante causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espírito Zubera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'879b3632-bf06-40b1-a82e-6152bd0adc2a\', \'multiverseId\': 105719}, \'multiverseid\': 105719}, {\'name\': \'火眼无面鬼\', \'text\': \'当火眼无面鬼从场上进入坟墓场时，若它在本回合中受过4点或更多伤害，则火眼无面鬼对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～无面鬼／精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e1dc7f-401e-43d6-9550-5ac82e60a045\', \'multiverseId\': 104894}, \'multiverseid\': 104894}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutuhr\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers bringt dieser Spieler eine bleibende Karte, die er kontrolliert, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück, falls er nicht 2 Lebenspunkte bezahlt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'In einem Zeitalter der Kriege wird Zeit nicht in Sand, sondern in Blut gemessen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105221&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca560e8-cef0-4e9a-b9ec-0d7727c68a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 105221}, \'multiverseid\': 105221}, {\'name\': \'Reloj de sangre\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador regresa un permanente que controle a la mano de su propietario a menos que pague 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'En época de guerra, el tiempo no se mide con arena, sino con sangre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58520566-3f22-4b2e-87d1-294ebdcb659d\', \'multiverseId\': 105881}, \'multiverseid\': 105881}, {\'name\': \'Horloge de sang\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur renvoie un permanent qu\'il contrôle dans la main de son propriétaire à moins qu\'il ne paie 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'En période de guerre, le passage du temps ne se mesure pas en sable, mais en sang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105056&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'358d73ce-3293-4887-9e32-b18e27a6bf81\', \'multiverseId\': 105056}, \'multiverseid\': 105056}, {\'name\': \'Mantello di Sangue\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del proprio mantenimento, ogni giocatore fa tornare in mano al proprietario un permanente che controlla a meno che quel giocatore paghi 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "In un\'epoca di guerre, il tempo viene misurato non con la sabbia ma con il sangue.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'573b81cb-c771-4193-8fa2-03b0a7467b2d\', \'multiverseId\': 105386}, \'multiverseid\': 105386}, {\'name\': \'血の時計\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーが２点のライフを支払わないかぎり、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするパーマネントを１つオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'戦乱の時代、時は砂ではなく血で計った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f694c11-0b38-43e3-8887-282f3a85f642\', \'multiverseId\': 105551}, \'multiverseid\': 105551}, {\'name\': \'Relógio de Sangue\', \'text\': \'No início da manutenção de cada jogador, aquele jogador devolve uma permanente que ele próprio controla para a mão de seu dono a menos que ele pague 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Em tempos de guerra, o tempo não é medido com areia, mas sim com sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb635ce8-c5cd-43d9-8ff3-ea8a058c1d81\', \'multiverseId\': 105716}, \'multiverseid\': 105716}, {\'name\': \'鲜血时计\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的维持开始时，除非他支付2点生命，否则该牌手将一个由他操控的永久物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'烽火频仍的岁月里，时间不再以细沙计量，而是用血滴测度。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d02a33b-5190-42c6-a2b3-ef8a5eb35035\', \'multiverseId\': 104891}, \'multiverseid\': 104891}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bunreis Versprechungen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, opfere Bunreis Versprechungen. Falls du dies tust, bringe vier 1/1 farblose Geist-Spielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe keine Angst davor, heute zu sterben, und auch keine Angst vor dem, was der Tod bringen wird."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105330&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af5efe4d-e036-4755-a1fb-db9bd9fd86da\', \'multiverseId\': 105330}, \'multiverseid\': 105330}, {\'name\': \'Promesa de bunrei\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controles vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, sacrifica la Promesa de bunrei. Si lo haces, pon en juego cuatro fichas de criatura Espíritu incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"No tengo miedo de morir hoy, ni de lo que la muerte traerá."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5b677e-816e-46f4-8106-eb204eb85037\', \'multiverseId\': 105990}, \'multiverseid\': 105990}, {\'name\': \'Promesse du bunrei\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, sacrifiez la Promesse du bunrei. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez en jeu quatre jetons de créature 1/1 incolore Esprit.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne crains pas la mort, ni ce que la mort apporte. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3517b2-0117-4670-8319-902296c95e78\', \'multiverseId\': 105165}, \'multiverseid\': 105165}, {\'name\': \'Promessa di Bunrei\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, sacrifica la Promessa di Bunrei. Se lo fai, metti in gioco quattro pedine creatura Spirito 1/1 incolori.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ho paura di morire oggi, né temo ciò che la morte porterà."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31efe074-1496-4a31-91c4-4b1ac265dbaa\', \'multiverseId\': 105495}, \'multiverseid\': 105495}, {\'name\': \'分霊の確約\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするいずれかのクリーチャーが場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、分霊の確約を生け贄に捧げる。 そうした場合、無色の1/1のスピリット･クリーチャー・トークンを４体場に出す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント（場）\', \'flavor\': \'今日死すことも恐れず、死が何をもたらすかも恐れぬ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52c7d66-1b0f-4624-890b-ef7cc9b6d967\', \'multiverseId\': 105660}, \'multiverseid\': 105660}, {\'name\': \'Promessa de Bunrei\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla for colocada num cemitério vinda de jogo, sacrifique Promessa de Bunrei. Se o fizer, coloque em jogo quatros fichas de criatura incolor 1/1 do tipo Espírito.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Não tenho medo de morrer hoje nem do que a morte vai trazer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'042972d5-ef53-4ab6-bb0f-6433406fda2a\', \'multiverseId\': 105825}, \'multiverseid\': 105825}, {\'name\': \'分灵之诺\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物从场上置入坟墓场时，牺牲分灵之诺。 若你如此作，则将四个1/1无色精怪衍生物放置进场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我不怕命丧今朝，亦无惧身后际遇。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'babcafea-00b5-455d-b3b7-7e45d3432953\', \'multiverseId\': 105000}, \'multiverseid\': 105000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Land bestellen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Land ins Spiel kommt, bringt sein Beherrscher einen 1/1 grünen Ophis-Spielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Traurig und hoffnungsvoll zugleich verließ Senka mit ihren Dienerinnen ihre Geburtskolonie, um als Brutmeisterin und damit Gründerin einer neuen Kolonie zu dienen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105347&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c179893-e70a-4774-a688-a7ae40285c45\', \'multiverseId\': 105347}, \'multiverseid\': 105347}, {\'name\': \'Sembrar la tierra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una tierra entre en juego, su controlador pone en juego una ficha de criatura Víbora verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Con tristeza y esperanza, Senka dejó su colonia de nacimiento y, con sus asistentes, se alejó para servir como señora de la camada, fundadora de una nueva colonia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=106007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a71b1c-697a-496c-bc0e-9125ed4126cd\', \'multiverseId\': 106007}, \'multiverseid\': 106007}, {\'name\': \'Ensemencement de la terre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive en jeu, son contrôleur met en jeu un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Serpent.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Triste et pleine d\'espoir, Senka quitta sa colonie de naissance et, accompagnée par ses suivants, elle devint la maîtresse de la couvée d\'une nouvelle colonie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d855ebd4-f9c6-4362-b3fc-84244f1b16f1\', \'multiverseId\': 105182}, \'multiverseid\': 105182}, {\'name\': \'Seminare la Terra\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una terra entra in gioco, il suo controllore mette in gioco una pedina creatura Serpente 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Con un misto di tristezza e speranza, Senka lasciò la propria colonia di origine e, con il proprio seguito, si diresse a fondare una nuova colonia in veste di signora della covata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6488cf5c-129a-4e5f-926b-172fde9b5fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 105512}, \'multiverseid\': 105512}, {\'name\': \'地に種\', \'text\': \'いずれかの土地が場に出るたび、それのコントローラーは緑の1/1の蛇クリーチャー・トークン１体を場に出す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント（場）\', \'flavor\': \'せん香は悲しみと希望を胸に生まれた集落を離れた。そして、彼女が現れたことで育み手が求められ、新たな集落が生まれる基礎となった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f8095d1-e96e-408a-93f4-93b91246db55\', \'multiverseId\': 105677}, \'multiverseid\': 105677}, {\'name\': \'Semear a Terra\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um terreno entra em jogo, o seu controlador coloca em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Cobra.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Com tristeza e um sentimento de esperança, Senka deixou a colônia onde nascera, com seus assistentes, para servir como genitora da ninhada, fundadora de uma nova colônia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9be4e5e-9233-4384-8de9-bf19616e2d23\', \'multiverseId\': 105842}, \'multiverseid\': 105842}, {\'name\': \'开疆辟壤\', \'text\': \'每当一个地进场时，其操控者将一个1/1绿色蛇衍生物放置进场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'宣香怀着悲念与希望，带着从众离开自己出生的群落，以新群落女王的身分开创未来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c184b7-f84c-475f-9daf-7289be6680b2\', \'multiverseId\': 105017}, \'multiverseid\': 105017}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Horizont absuchen\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei Standardländern, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe alle Aspekte dieses großartigen Lands gesehen. Ich kenne jeden Baum, Stein und jede Flussbiegung. Doch ich musste erkennen, dass zwischen Kennen und Heilen ein großer Unterschied steckt."Azusas Tagebuch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105348&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47579910-6c6a-448f-9365-995d0ba0de8c\', \'multiverseId\': 105348}, \'multiverseid\': 105348}, {\'name\': \'Buscar el horizonte\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas y ponlas en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"He visto esta gran tierra desde todos los ángulos. Conozco cada árbol, piedra y curva de los ríos. Aún así, he descubierto que conocer algo no es lo mismo que curarlo."Diario de Azusa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=106008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b5e8839-60b6-4908-a76b-75a65c1dce43\', \'multiverseId\': 106008}, \'multiverseid\': 106008}, {\'name\': "À la recherche de l\'horizon", \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain de base, révélez-les et mettez-les dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai vu cette grande terre sous tous ses angles. Je connais ses arbres, ses pierres et ses fleuves dans leurs moindres détails. Pourtant, je sais maintenant que connaître une chose et la sauver sont deux choses différentes. »Journal d\'Azusa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105183&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f1de41-c452-4475-9051-1dceb4f26f18\', \'multiverseId\': 105183}, \'multiverseid\': 105183}, {\'name\': "Cercare l\'Orizzonte", \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio, scegli fino a tre carte terra base, rivelale e aggiungile alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho visto questa grande terra da ogni angolo. Ne conosco ogni albero, pietra e ansa di fiume. E tuttavia ho imparato che conoscere una cosa non è lo stesso che curarla."Diario di Azusa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b7fbda-3a65-4750-95b0-1bba259be35e\', \'multiverseId\': 105513}, \'multiverseid\': 105513}, {\'name\': \'地平の探求\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本地形を最大３枚探し、それらを公開してあなたの手札に加える。 その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'我、この偉大なる地をあらゆる方向より見ぬ。 樹も、石も、川のうねる様もすべて知りたり。 しかれども、そを知ることはそを癒すこととは異なるもまた事実。――梓日記\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ddf1b3f-7cdb-4007-9442-afc3f62c6944\', \'multiverseId\': 105678}, \'multiverseid\': 105678}, {\'name\': \'Procurar o Horizonte\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório por até três cards de terreno básico, revele-os, e coloque-os em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Observei esse grande território de todos os ângulos. Conheço todas as suas árvores, pedras e as curvas de seus rios. Ainda assim eu percebi que conhecer uma coisa não é o mesmo que curá-la." Diário de Azusa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aee2c284-5e9f-4c14-acea-811e8ceb6107\', \'multiverseId\': 105843}, \'multiverseid\': 105843}, {\'name\': \'探寻天际\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多三张基本地牌，展示该些牌，并置于你手上， 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我已从各种角度观察这片大地。 我认识每株树，每颗石头，每段河弯。 但得到的结论却令我灰心：对事物了解再深，也不足以治愈其伤。」～梓纱的日记\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23eac85f-0d3f-4518-a069-2f59ab510cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 105018}, \'multiverseid\': 105018}]', "[{'name': 'Dichtes Blätterdach', 'text': 'Fliegende Kreaturen können nichtfliegende Kreaturen nicht blocken.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Die Orochi lernten schnell, wie man sich sicher auf dem Waldboden bewegte ähnlich wie Fische, die durch von Möwen überwachte Gewässer flitzen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105237&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd35bcd00-c595-4e88-895e-ffb48e519dd8', 'multiverseId': 105237}, 'multiverseid': 105237}, {'name': 'Enramada densa', 'text': 'Las criaturas con la habilidad de volar no pueden bloquear a las criaturas sin la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Los orochi aprendieron a moverse ágilmente y con pie firme sobre el suelo del bosque, como peces en aguas vigiladas por gaviotas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105897&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcb5fa9b-5702-4cf5-819c-572413dece36', 'multiverseId': 105897}, 'multiverseid': 105897}, {'name': 'Canopée dense', 'text': 'Les créatures avec le vol ne peuvent pas bloquer les créatures sans le vol.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Les orochi avaient appris à se déplacer dans la forêt, tels des poissons dans des eaux gardées par les mouettes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105072&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e5ffcca-48ac-4208-a174-6fd1aceaa2d0', 'multiverseId': 105072}, 'multiverseid': 105072}, {'name': 'Fronde Intricate', 'text': 'Le creature con volare non possono bloccare le creature senza volare.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Gli orochi impararono a muoversi lesti e sicuri per la foresta, simili a pesci che attraversano guizzando acque sorvegliate da gabbiani.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105402&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58ab9dc9-5cf0-4599-8fe2-46b62df4a4f6', 'multiverseId': 105402}, 'multiverseid': 105402}, {'name': '密集した梢', 'text': '飛行を持つクリーチャーは、飛行を持たないクリーチャーのブロックに参加できない。', 'type': 'エンチャント（場）', 'flavor': '大蛇は森の地面を素早く確実に動く術を学ぶ。それは鴎が睨みを利かす水の中を矢のように泳ぐ魚のようだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105567&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e5c3c70-ded6-4d7d-a0f8-399caab75993', 'multiverseId': 105567}, 'multiverseid': 105567}, {'name': 'Copas Densas', 'text': 'As criaturas com a habilidade de voar não podem bloquear criaturas sem a habilidade de voar.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Os orochis aprenderam como mover-se rápida e seguramente pelo chão da floresta, como peixes lançando-se pelas águas observadas por gaivotas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105732&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '319183e0-f7cf-446c-85ad-bc4f3c341de9', 'multiverseId': 105732}, 'multiverseid': 105732}, {'name': '浓密林冠', 'text': '具飞行异能的生物不能阻挡不具飞行异能的生物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '就像鱼儿悠游于海鸥窥伺的水域，蛇人也知道在林间梭巡的平安要诀。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104907&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89d5d57c-295a-48b1-bc2b-73659d762823', 'multiverseId': 104907}, 'multiverseid': 104907}]", '[{\'name\': \'Die Horde zusammentrommeln\', \'text\': \'Entferne die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ganz aus dem Spiel. Falls die letzte entfernte Karte kein Land ist, wiederhole diesen Prozess, bis die letzte entfernte Karte ein Land ist. Bringe für jede Nichtland-Karte, die auf diese Weise ganz aus dem Spiel entfernt wurde, einen 1/1 roten Krieger-Spielstein ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105333&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d27c3fd0-46e3-403d-9860-dc0cc7681088\', \'multiverseId\': 105333}, \'multiverseid\': 105333}, {\'name\': \'Agrupar la horda\', \'text\': \'Remueve del juego las primeras tres cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Si la última carta removida no es una tierra, repite este proceso hasta que la última carta removida sea una tierra. Pon en juego una ficha de criatura Guerrero roja 1/1 por cada carta que no sea tierra removida del juego de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe09048-556f-45f9-a4d1-6b721733304e\', \'multiverseId\': 105993}, \'multiverseid\': 105993}, {\'name\': \'Ralliement de la horde\', \'text\': "Retirez de la partie les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si la dernière carte retirée n\'est pas un terrain, continuez ainsi jusqu\'à ce que la dernière carte retirée soit un terrain. Mettez en jeu un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Guerrier pour chaque carte non-terrain retirée de la partie de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2485844-8faa-40c8-8bba-61f40d15ab49\', \'multiverseId\': 105168}, \'multiverseid\': 105168}, {\'name\': "Radunare l\'Orda", \'text\': "Rimuovi dal gioco le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Se l\'ultima carta rimossa non è una terra, ripeti questo procedimento finché l\'ultima carta rimossa è una terra. Metti in gioco una pedina creatura Guerriero 1/1 rossa per ogni carta non terra rimossa dal gioco in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7921ff9e-29d8-4c1e-a8d6-035b5017660d\', \'multiverseId\': 105498}, \'multiverseid\': 105498}, {\'name\': \'大軍の結集\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードをゲームから取り除く。 取り除いた最後の１枚のカードが土地でない場合、この手順を取り除いた最後の１枚のカードが土地であるまで繰り返す。 これにより取り除かれた土地でないカード１枚につき、赤の1/1の戦士クリーチャー・トークンを１体場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c461b01f-aa6b-4d93-a800-8a8b4c7b9ac6\', \'multiverseId\': 105663}, \'multiverseid\': 105663}, {\'name\': \'Reunir a Horda\', \'text\': \'Remove de jogo os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Se o último card removido não é um terreno, repita este processo até que o último card removido seja um terreno. Coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Guerreiro para cada card que não seja um terreno removido de jogo dessa maneira.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d4279e6-d192-4387-805a-df5529545dc3\', \'multiverseId\': 105828}, \'multiverseid\': 105828}, {\'name\': \'集结大军\', \'text\': \'将你牌库顶的三张牌移出对战。 若最后移出的牌不是地牌，则重复此步骤，直到最后移出的牌是地牌为止。 每以此法将一张非地的牌移出对战，便将一个1/1红色战士衍生物放置进场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32b09d05-4b41-4bf4-bf86-26ea7fe853de\', \'multiverseId\': 105003}, \'multiverseid\': 105003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorngeflecht-Kami\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Geist oder einen arkanen Zauber spielst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Dorn zum Warnen, zehn Dornen zum Verteidigen, hundert Dornen zum Zerstören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105223&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca5a7f38-e331-4758-b15f-698c584b5924\', \'multiverseId\': 105223}, \'multiverseid\': 105223}, {\'name\': \'Kami zarzatejida\', \'text\': \'Siempre que juegues un hechizo arcano o de Espíritu, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Una espina para avisar, diez para defender, cien para destruir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0448b60-3c9b-4f1b-b80f-be3f7956d7aa\', \'multiverseId\': 105883}, \'multiverseid\': 105883}, {\'name\': \'Kami de ronces\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous jouez un sort d\'esprit ou d\'arcane, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Une épine pour prévenir, dix épines pour défendre, cent épines pour détruire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105058&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfbac261-0ba5-4cbf-b340-2ee1614d5025\', \'multiverseId\': 105058}, \'multiverseid\': 105058}, {\'name\': \'Kami del Ginepraio Spinato\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta giochi una magia Spirito o Arcano, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Una spina per avvisare, dieci spine per difendere, cento spine per distruggere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb9bbdb-c48b-453b-84d2-fed48e36059a\', \'multiverseId\': 105388}, \'multiverseid\': 105388}, {\'name\': \'茨編みの神\', \'text\': \'あなたがスピリット呪文か秘儀呪文をプレイするたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'棘一本は脅し、棘十本は護り、棘百本は滅し。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5351eb5-af76-427d-88b0-bb4cdcbf4eac\', \'multiverseId\': 105553}, \'multiverseid\': 105553}, {\'name\': \'Kami de Urze-branca\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você jogar uma mágica Arcana ou de Espírito, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Um espinho para advertir, dez espinhos para defender, cem espinhos para destruir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ba01e71-e210-471a-9f06-e25429d04476\', \'multiverseId\': 105718}, \'multiverseid\': 105718}, {\'name\': \'荆织神\', \'text\': \'每当你使用精怪或古咒咒语时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'以一根刺作为警告，用十根刺来防卫，拿百根刺来歼灭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86a2e27d-4a7a-499e-b1a8-0fef9beedb7e\', \'multiverseId\': 104893}, \'multiverseid\': 104893}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dosans Ältester Gesang\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 6 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als Dosans Gesang anschwoll, erhob sich eine tiefere Stimme in Harmonie, stark genug, um die Erde erzittern zu lassen, und doch klingend genug, um den Geist zu erfüllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105241&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fef998f-2d27-42ad-bbca-04ee74d4f44d\', \'multiverseId\': 105241}, \'multiverseid\': 105241}, {\'name\': \'El canto más antiguo de Dosan\', \'text\': \'Gana 6 vidas.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras el canto de Dosan crecía en volumen, una segunda voz, más profunda, se alzó en armonía, fuerte como para sacudir la tierra pero vibrante como para llenar el espíritu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d3ba1d-8e09-4e44-896d-081d8c74941e\', \'multiverseId\': 105901}, \'multiverseid\': 105901}, {\'name\': \'Chant le plus ancien de Dosan\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 6 points de vie.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Alors que le chant de Dosan s\'intensifiait, une deuxième voix se joignit à la sienne, assez forte pour faire trembler la terre, assez vibrante pour renforcer l\'esprit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105076&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3674676a-b6ee-4c39-a44c-ed92f6efb31b\', \'multiverseId\': 105076}, \'multiverseid\': 105076}, {\'name\': \'Antico Canto di Dosan\', \'text\': \'Guadagni 6 punti vita.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre il canto di Dosan saliva di intensità, una seconda voce, più profonda, si unì armoniosamente alla sua, abbastanza forte da scuotere la terra e al tempo stesso così viva da colmare lo spirito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b92998-c19d-4121-bcd6-2ae286c2cabe\', \'multiverseId\': 105406}, \'multiverseid\': 105406}, {\'name\': \'道三の最古の詠唱\', \'text\': \'あなたは６点のライフを得る\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'道三の詠唱が大きく響き渡った時、第二の深い声がそれに合わせるように背後から起こった。それは地を揺るがすほど強く、魂を満たすほど活き活きとしていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c90c7305-e16d-4e80-80bd-a5ad332c81f2\', \'multiverseId\': 105571}, \'multiverseid\': 105571}, {\'name\': \'O Canto Mais Antigo de Dosan\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 6 pontos de vida.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme o canto de Dosan aumentava de volume, uma segunda voz mais profunda surgiu em harmonia no fundo, forte o suficiente para abalar a terra e ao mesmo tempo vibrante o suficiente para preencher o espírito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b042387a-c99a-458e-a241-b3daab810e34\', \'multiverseId\': 105736}, \'multiverseid\': 105736}, {\'name\': \'道三古颂\', \'text\': \'你获得6点生命。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'道三逐渐放开音量吟诵，随后好似有更深层的声响与之唱和，其势惊天撼地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe6a4644-68a5-4931-9cbb-d52a0f8f6c31\', \'multiverseId\': 104911}, \'multiverseid\': 104911}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durch Reito pflügen\', \'text\': \'Wegfegen Bringe eine beliebige Anzahl an Ebenen, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück. Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges für jede auf diese Weise zurückgebrachte Ebene.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber - Arkan\', \'flavor\': \'Die Pfade der Kami durchzogen Kamigawa wie Narben, die ein verrückter Chirurg zurücklässt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'794a70d6-211e-4d1c-8da7-6ec024af3934\', \'multiverseId\': 105328}, \'multiverseid\': 105328}, {\'name\': \'Arar atravesando Reito\', \'text\': \'Recolectar Regresa cualquier número de llanuras que controles a la mano de su propietario. La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada llanura que hayas regresado de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'Los caminos de los kami cruzaban Kamigawa como cicatrices hechas por un cirujano loco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4371000c-9f26-46cc-ba29-23015e9ed1ee\', \'multiverseId\': 105988}, \'multiverseid\': 105988}, {\'name\': \'Traversée de Reito\', \'text\': "Balayage — Renvoyez n\'importe quel nombre de plaines que vous contrôlez dans la main de leur propriétaire. La créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque plaine renvoyée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère : arcane\', \'flavor\': \'Le passage des kami marquait Kamigawa comme des cicatrices laissées par un chirurgien fou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c2f45d-2983-47c2-888d-999363ab41de\', \'multiverseId\': 105163}, \'multiverseid\': 105163}, {\'name\': \'Rivoltare Reito\', \'text\': \'Spazzar via Fai tornare in mano al proprietario un qualsiasi numero di Pianure che controlli. La creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni Pianura ripresa in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'I sentieri dei kami solcavano Kamigawa come le cicatrici lasciate da un chirurgo impazzito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a37688d9-1dbf-47ed-9b64-d946040b082f\', \'multiverseId\': 105493}, \'multiverseid\': 105493}, {\'name\': \'霊都の耕作\', \'text\': \'掃引――あなたがコントロールする平地を望む数だけオーナーの手札に戻す。 クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで、これにより戻された平地１枚につき+1/+1の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': \'神の通り道は、怒り狂える施術の傷跡のように神河を縦横無尽に走った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d213a8bb-ea66-4e75-b00d-ccadb63142ff\', \'multiverseId\': 105658}, \'multiverseid\': 105658}, {\'name\': \'Avançar Através de Reito\', \'text\': \'Varredura Devolve qualquer número de Planícies que você controla para a mão de seu dono. A criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada Planície devolvida dessa maneira.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea - Arcana\', \'flavor\': \'Os caminhos dos kamis entrecruzaram Kamigawa como cicatrizes deixadas por um cirurgião enlouquecido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9290b228-7233-4bc1-9932-405ca14e9ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 105823}, \'multiverseid\': 105823}, {\'name\': \'犁平灵都\', \'text\': \'扫平～将任意数量由你操控的平原移回其拥有者手上。 每以此法移回一个平原，目标生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间～古咒\', \'flavor\': \'神明行迹交错于神河大地，宛如疯医刀痕。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc292520-b3d3-4746-a2e9-cea6cec70c53\', \'multiverseId\': 104998}, \'multiverseid\': 104998}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durch Sokenzan preschen\', \'text\': \'Wegfegen Bringe eine beliebige Anzahl an Gebirgen, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Durch Sokenzan preschen fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in doppelter Höhe der Anzahl der Gebirge, die auf diese Weise zurückgebracht wurden, zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber - Arkan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105220&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb408188-bcca-4407-a8a3-23a66748d8a5\', \'multiverseId\': 105220}, \'multiverseid\': 105220}, {\'name\': \'Cuesta abajo por Sokenzan\', \'text\': \'Recolectar Regresa cualquier número de montañas que controles a la mano de su propietario. Cuesta abajo por Sokenzan hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura objetivo igual al doble del número de montañas que hayas regresado de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5184c511-cb8b-4f53-8eea-16926fb50cfe\', \'multiverseId\': 105880}, \'multiverseid\': 105880}, {\'name\': \'Descente du Sokenzan\', \'text\': "Balayage — Renvoyez n\'importe quel nombre de montagnes que vous contrôlez dans la main de leur propriétaire. La Descente du Sokenzan inflige à la créature ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au double du nombre de montagnes renvoyées de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère : arcane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3728b9d-d9c3-4153-bcf0-647a8fde9de4\', \'multiverseId\': 105055}, \'multiverseid\': 105055}, {\'name\': \'Sokenzan Spianato\', \'text\': \'Spazzar via Fai tornare in mano al proprietario un qualsiasi numero di Montagne che controlli. Lo Sokenzan Spianato infligge a una creatura bersaglio un danno pari al doppio del numero di Montagne riprese in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'583c9255-90f4-41ac-bdd3-83f5fcc05ad8\', \'multiverseId\': 105385}, \'multiverseid\': 105385}, {\'name\': \'霜剣山の逆落とし\', \'text\': \'掃引――あなたがコントロールする山を望む数だけオーナーの手札に戻す。 クリーチャー１体を対象とする。霜剣山の逆落としはそれに、これにより戻された山の総数の２倍に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e8a046c-73ca-4d15-bb04-d2d9bd92ca62\', \'multiverseId\': 105550}, \'multiverseid\': 105550}, {\'name\': \'Investindo Sokenzan Abaixo\', \'text\': \'Varredura Devolve qualquer número de Montanhas que você controla para a mão de seu dono. Investindo Sokenzan Abaixo causa uma quantidade de dano à criatura alvo igual a duas vezes o número de Montanhas devolvidas dessa maneira.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea - Arcana\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f9fdb17-6876-4d4d-b896-cf65929ef266\', \'multiverseId\': 105715}, \'multiverseid\': 105715}, {\'name\': \'杀下霜剑山\', \'text\': \'扫平～将任意数量由你操控的山脉移回其拥有者手上。 杀下霜剑山对目标生物造成伤害，其数量等同于以此法移回之山脉数量的两倍。\', \'type\': \'瞬间～古咒\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f1ff26-4486-47aa-9458-ab1eb0df6a70\', \'multiverseId\': 104890}, \'multiverseid\': 104890}]', "[{'name': 'Durch Weisheit eingeschüchtert', 'text': 'Die verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, falls ihr Beherrscher nicht {1} für jede Karte auf deiner Hand bezahlt. (Diese Kosten werden bezahlt, sowie Angreifer oder Blocker deklariert werden.)', 'type': 'Kreaturenverzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105230&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48a39dbb-89fb-46ef-b37f-ad61552bade1', 'multiverseId': 105230}, 'multiverseid': 105230}, {'name': 'Acobardado por la sabiduría', 'text': 'La criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear a menos que su controlador pague {1} por cada carta en tu mano. (Este coste se paga cuando se declaran los atacantes o bloqueadores.)', 'type': 'Encantar criatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105890&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '206575e8-cfec-4ff4-8c8c-ceeb42de1209', 'multiverseId': 105890}, 'multiverseid': 105890}, {'name': 'Intimidé par la sagesse', 'text': 'La créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer, ni bloquer à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {1} pour chaque carte dans votre main. (Ce coût est payé au moment où les attaquants ou les bloqueurs sont déclarés.)', 'type': 'Enchanter : créature', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105065&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d53812a-c25a-4f1e-b60d-481de614f8a9', 'multiverseId': 105065}, 'multiverseid': 105065}, {'name': 'Intimidito dalla Saggezza', 'text': 'La creatura incantata non può attaccare né bloccare a meno che il suo controllore spenda {1} per ogni carta che hai in mano. (Questo costo è pagato mentre vengono dichiarate le creature attaccanti o bloccanti.)', 'type': 'Incanta Creatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105395&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82f80d58-e4e5-4495-92e2-2fa58642d048', 'multiverseId': 105395}, 'multiverseid': 105395}, {'name': '知恵への怯え', 'text': 'エンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーがあなたの手札にあるカード１枚につき{1}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃やブロックに参加できない。 （このコストは、攻撃クリーチャーやブロック・クリーチャーが選ばれる際に支払う。）', 'type': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105560&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a987a36-6190-4c74-b2b9-c36d7eb6fd08', 'multiverseId': 105560}, 'multiverseid': 105560}, {'name': 'Intimidado pela Sabedoria', 'text': 'A criatura encantada não pode atacar ou bloquear a menos que seu controlador pague {1} para cada card em sua mão. (Este custo é pago conforme os atacantes ou bloqueadores são declarados.)', 'type': 'Encantar Criatura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105725&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2d7d6f5-7ff2-4837-bbe6-d90ca6d69388', 'multiverseId': 105725}, 'multiverseid': 105725}, {'name': '为智畏服', 'text': '除非受此结界之生物的操控者为你手上每张牌各支付{1}，否则它不能进行攻击或阻挡。 （于宣告攻击者或阻挡者时支付此费用）', 'type': '生物结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104900&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c27b466-ba15-4333-941a-5afbd0aba283', 'multiverseId': 104900}, 'multiverseid': 104900}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ehrerbietung\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger können dich nicht angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Trotz der geballten Kräfte, die sich gegen ihn verbündeten, glaubte Konda nie daran, dass er den Kami-Krieg verlieren würde."\\n—Masako die Humorlose\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105338&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6e709fd-8b25-4f41-80b4-151d5bdcb540\', \'multiverseId\': 105338}, \'multiverseid\': 105338}, {\'name\': \'Reverencia\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos no pueden atacarte.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"A pesar de las fuerzas inmensas aliadas en su contra, Konda nunca creyó que podría perder la guerra con los kami."\\n—Masako la malhumorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1d5820f-d0cf-47f4-9472-14e281de7401\', \'multiverseId\': 105998}, \'multiverseid\': 105998}, {\'name\': \'Vénération\', \'text\': \'Les créatures de force 2 ou moins ne peuvent pas vous attaquer.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« En dépit des forces alliées contre lui, Konda ne crut jamais qu\'il pourrait perdre la Guerre des kami. »\\n—Masako la taciturne", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81e594ea-36f4-4b34-a05e-6592dbe4babb\', \'multiverseId\': 105173}, \'multiverseid\': 105173}, {\'name\': \'Venerazione\', \'text\': \'Le creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2 non possono attaccarti.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Malgrado le imponenti forze che si unirono per fronteggiarlo, Konda non pensò neppure per un istante che avrebbe potuto perdere la Guerra dei Kami."\\n—Masako il Senza Sorriso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c2a9d9-9f34-4ac1-a827-ece1abede236\', \'multiverseId\': 105503}, \'multiverseid\': 105503}, {\'name\': \'崇敬\', \'text\': \'パワーが２以下のクリーチャーはあなたへの攻撃に参加できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント（場）\', \'flavor\': \'今田に立ち向かう軍勢のいかに大きかろうとも、彼が神の乱に負けることを考えるなど一度たりとも無し。\\n――生真面目な君、昌子\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f17a84d-5661-4cfd-bad6-b6cb49cf555d\', \'multiverseId\': 105668}, \'multiverseid\': 105668}, {\'name\': \'Reverência\', \'text\': \'As criaturas com poder menor ou igual a 2 não podem atacá-lo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Apesar das forças maciças que se aliavam contra ele, Konda nunca acreditou que perderia a Guerra dos Kamis."\\n— Masako a Desanimada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a185af79-90d5-42b9-a210-0b4feec9ff5f\', \'multiverseId\': 105833}, \'multiverseid\': 105833}, {\'name\': \'崇敬\', \'text\': \'力量等于或小于2的生物不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「在庞大的军势集结起来对抗他之前，今田从不相信自己会输掉这场逆神之战。」\\n～老古板昌子\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1860972d-c6a0-4223-8a98-1c070a60788b\', \'multiverseId\': 105008}, \'multiverseid\': 105008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eiganjos Freiheitsreiter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBringe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine weiße Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Luft war von Staub erfüllt und die Geräusche von Flügelschlagen übertönten alles. Die Mottenreiter waren angekommen."Die Großen Schlachten von Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105244&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d962ce7-b65d-43b9-92f5-da6cf162b788\', \'multiverseId\': 105244}, \'multiverseid\': 105244}, {\'name\': \'Jinetes libres de Eiganjo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, regresa una criatura blanca que controles a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El aire se llenó de polvo y sonidos de aleteos. Los jinetes de polillas se habían unido a la batalla."Grandes batallas de Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e9c8ad-4a9e-4ed8-a57c-590c397f81da\', \'multiverseId\': 105904}, \'multiverseid\': 105904}, {\'name\': "Libres-cavaliers d\'Eiganjo", \'text\': \'Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, renvoyez une créature blanche que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« L\'air se remplit de poussière et résonna du son des battements d\'ailes. Les chevauche-phalènes avaient rejoint le combat. »Grandes batailles de Kamigawa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'917a0e60-ca13-4136-aeaf-b91d13a281ab\', \'multiverseId\': 105079}, \'multiverseid\': 105079}, {\'name\': \'Cavalieri Liberi di Eiganjo\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, il proprietario riprende in mano una creatura bianca che tu controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura - Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'aria fu colma di polvere e del rumore d\\\'ali che battevano. I cavalcafalene si erano uniti alla battaglia."Le Grandi Battaglie di Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f98b96f-7df5-4c52-99ee-aa34807f1968\', \'multiverseId\': 105409}, \'multiverseid\': 105409}, {\'name\': \'永岩城の乗り手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがコントロールする白のクリーチャー１体をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'空気に埃と羽ばたきの音が満ちた。 戦乱に蛾乗りが加わったのだ。――神河大戦記\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'317727eb-03ee-4aac-8df7-3195ac367e77\', \'multiverseId\': 105574}, \'multiverseid\': 105574}, {\'name\': \'Ginetes Autônomos de Eiganjo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, devolva uma criatura branca que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Soldado Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"O ar encheu-se de poeira e do som de bater de asas. Os ginetes de mariposas se juntaram a luta."As Grandes Batalhas de Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6cbf1f-6e50-4de8-98c0-2cd192d7aee6\', \'multiverseId\': 105739}, \'multiverseid\': 105739}, {\'name\': \'永岩城翔骑兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，将一个由你操控的白色生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「大气间漫布飞灰与翼响；蛾骑士已加入战团。」 ～神河战记\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b500a8f-d6c0-4b79-be71-6609596e882d\', \'multiverseId\': 104914}, \'multiverseid\': 104914}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eins mit dem Nichts\', \'text\': \'Wirf die Karten auf deiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn nichts bleibt, ist alles gleichermaßen möglich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105321&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01206fda-c150-4862-9e72-0a2fd2449ade\', \'multiverseId\': 105321}, \'multiverseid\': 105321}, {\'name\': \'En armonía con la nada\', \'text\': \'Descarta tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando no queda nada, todo es igualmente posible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77952aaa-0bfe-4676-948f-a234ffbdf011\', \'multiverseId\': 105981}, \'multiverseid\': 105981}, {\'name\': \'Fusion avec le néant\', \'text\': \'Défaussez-vous de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Quand seul le néant subsiste, tout est possible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ab614f-c0c5-4a08-b04e-dafd28cffa25\', \'multiverseId\': 105156}, \'multiverseid\': 105156}, {\'name\': "Tutt\'uno con il Nulla", \'text\': \'Scarta la tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando non rimane nulla, tutto è possibile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd675dc4-794c-45ab-a47c-4fa206e5297c\', \'multiverseId\': 105486}, \'multiverseid\': 105486}, {\'name\': \'空虚自身\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'何も残らなければ、すべての可能性が等しくなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a7ff6e-c313-49dc-bc85-447e0354de13\', \'multiverseId\': 105651}, \'multiverseid\': 105651}, {\'name\': \'Um com o Nada\', \'text\': \'Descarte sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando nada resta, tudo é igualmente possível.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2535c069-a2a7-4362-b007-aaca287012ca\', \'multiverseId\': 105816}, \'multiverseid\': 105816}, {\'name\': \'无何有\', \'text\': \'弃掉你的手牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'回归空无，才得见万物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'591d2287-bdc9-47b6-aac5-295433a11bf0\', \'multiverseId\': 104991}, \'multiverseid\': 104991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elite des Kashi-Stamms\', \'text\': \'Legendäre Ophis, die du kontrollierst, können nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.\\nImmer wenn die Elite des Kashi-Stamms einer Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, tappe diese Kreatur, und sie enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Ophis, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105287&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8b55029-61ce-4af0-9d90-5218c7c7aaf2\', \'multiverseId\': 105287}, \'multiverseid\': 105287}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la tribu Kashi\', \'text\': \'Las Víboras legendarias que controles no pueden ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.Siempre que la Élite de la tribu Kashi haga daño de combate a una criatura, gírala y esa criatura no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Guerrero víbora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c802ba5-3998-46f1-9192-82f9319f5604\', \'multiverseId\': 105947}, \'multiverseid\': 105947}, {\'name\': \'Élite de la tribu Kashi\', \'text\': "Les serpents légendaires que vous contrôlez ne peuvent être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Élite de la tribu Kashi inflige des blessures de combat à une créature, engagez cette créature et elle ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : serpent et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5f4ce88-cfaa-4386-838c-168eac54541d\', \'multiverseId\': 105122}, \'multiverseid\': 105122}, {\'name\': \'Elite della Tribù-Kashi\', \'text\': "I Serpenti Leggendari che controlli non possono essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Elite della Tribù-Kashi infligge danno da combattimento a una creatura, TAPpa quella creatura ed essa non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.", \'type\': \'Creatura - Guerriero Serpente\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adab2b1f-e514-4f67-a814-404013fae05b\', \'multiverseId\': 105452}, \'multiverseid\': 105452}, {\'name\': \'樫族の精鋭\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする伝説の蛇は呪文や能力の対象にならない。\\n樫族の精鋭がいずれかのクリーチャーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのクリーチャーをタップする。そのクリーチャーはそれのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248b7400-8463-4d74-8e05-a70189a405fa\', \'multiverseId\': 105617}, \'multiverseid\': 105617}, {\'name\': \'Elite da Tribo do Kashi\', \'text\': \'As Cobras Lendárias que você controla não podem ser alvos de mágicas nem de habilidades.\\nToda vez que Elite da Tribo do Kashi causar dano de combate a uma criatura, vire-a e ela não desvira durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Guerreiro Cobra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eb108fa-8efb-4861-a5f9-c2edcd767aba\', \'multiverseId\': 105782}, \'multiverseid\': 105782}, {\'name\': \'橡宗精兵\', \'text\': \'由你操控的传奇蛇不能成为咒语或异能的目标。\\n每当橡宗精兵对生物造成战斗伤害时，横置该生物，且它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物～蛇／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e410d1-1cf8-49b2-b5e4-662601761cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 104957}, \'multiverseid\': 104957}]', '[{\'name\': \'Endloser Schwarm\', \'text\': \'Bringe für jede Karte auf deiner Hand einen 1/1 grünen Ophis-Spielstein ins Spiel.\\nEpisch (Für den Rest des Spiels kannst du keine Zaubersprüche spielen. Kopiere zu Beginn jedes deiner Versorgungssegmente diesen Zauberspruch außer seiner epischen Fähigkeit.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105246&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e38ab8ca-a597-4528-a9f6-f1c317e633e9\', \'multiverseId\': 105246}, \'multiverseid\': 105246}, {\'name\': \'Aluvión sin fin\', \'text\': \'Pon en juego una ficha de criatura Víbora verde 1/1 por cada carta que haya en tu mano.\\nÉpico (No puedes jugar hechizos por el resto del juego. Al comienzo de cada uno de tus mantenimientos, copia este hechizo excepto por su habilidad épica.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e79ad1c-3c14-40a9-8a65-e1351f0a164c\', \'multiverseId\': 105906}, \'multiverseid\': 105906}, {\'name\': \'Nuée interminable\', \'text\': "Mettez en jeu un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Serpent pour chaque carte dans votre main.\\nÉpique(Pour le restant de la partie, vous ne pouvez pas jouer de sorts. Au début de chacun de vos entretiens, copiez ce sort à l\'exception de sa capacité d\'épique.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105081&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ad02f5-b18e-4397-b5ef-15743c7f98f0\', \'multiverseId\': 105081}, \'multiverseid\': 105081}, {\'name\': \'Sciame Infinito\', \'text\': "Metti in gioco una pedina creatura Serpente 1/1 verde per ogni carta che hai in mano.\\nEpopea (Per il resto della partita, non puoi giocare magie. All\'inizio di ogni tuo mantenimento, copia questa magia tranne la sua abilità epopea.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa605e5-2954-40c3-939d-957f9fd55a6c\', \'multiverseId\': 105411}, \'multiverseid\': 105411}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき大群\', \'text\': \'緑の１/１の蛇クリーチャー・トークンを、あなたの手札にあるカード１枚につき１体場に出す。\\n歴伝 （残りのゲームの間、あなたは呪文をプレイできない。 あなたの各アップキープの開始時に、この呪文を歴伝能力を除いてコピーする。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64bbdb78-a065-4d8f-b73d-093cb0affdc0\', \'multiverseId\': 105576}, \'multiverseid\': 105576}, {\'name\': \'Enxame Interminável\', \'text\': \'Coloque em jogo uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Cobra para cada card em sua mão.\\nÉpica (Você não pode jogar mágicas pelo resto do duelo. No início de cada uma de suas manutenções, copie esta mágica menos sua habilidade épica.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9d961e-b4bc-46d9-a341-72c38c791f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 105741}, \'multiverseid\': 105741}, {\'name\': \'不竭蛇群\', \'text\': \'你每有一张手牌，便将一个1/1绿色蛇衍生物放置进场。\\n历传（这盘游戏结束之前，你不能使用咒语。 在你每回合的维持开始时，复制此咒语，但不包含其历传异能。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e514ad12-9df5-44b2-b800-bbe031fac5e6\', \'multiverseId\': 104916}, \'multiverseid\': 104916}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erinnerimmer\', \'text\': \'(Zaubersprüche ohne Manakosten können nicht gespielt werden.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\\nErinnerimmer ist blau.\\nArkane Kopplung {1}{U} (Sowie du einen arkanen Zauberspruch spielst, kannst du diese Karte aus deiner Hand vorzeigen und ihre Kopplungskosten bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, füge dem Zauberspruch den Effekt dieser Karte hinzu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber - Arkan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105250&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbc579c5-bf54-4d20-afa4-5477ca0371bd\', \'multiverseId\': 105250}, \'multiverseid\': 105250}, {\'name\': \'Mente eterna\', \'text\': \'(Los hechizos sin coste de maná no pueden jugarse.)\\nRoba una carta.\\nMente eterna es azul.\\nEmpalmar con lo arcano {1}{U} (En cuanto juegues un hechizo arcano, puedes mostrar esta carta de tu mano y pagar su coste de empalme. Si lo haces, agrega los efectos de esta carta a ese hechizo).\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4360e4e0-6c18-4f25-a804-7f36cacd2e05\', \'multiverseId\': 105910}, \'multiverseid\': 105910}, {\'name\': \'Souvenir éternel\', \'text\': "(Les sorts qui n\'ont pas de coût de mana ne peuvent pas être joués.)\\nPiochez une carte.\\nLe souvenir éternel est bleu.\\nImprégnation d\'arcane {1}{U} (Au moment où vous jouez un sort d\'arcane, vous pouvez révéler cette carte depuis votre main et payer son coût d\'imprégnation. Si vous le faites, ajoutez les effets de cette carte à ce sort.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère : arcane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105085&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac33d4ac-f399-49a0-bec3-a3ce226a24f7\', \'multiverseId\': 105085}, \'multiverseid\': 105085}, {\'name\': \'Menteterna\', \'text\': "(Le magie senza costo di mana non possono essere giocate.)\\nPesca una carta.\\nMenteterna è blu.\\nUnire nell\'Arcano {1}{U} (Mentre giochi una magia Arcano, puoi rivelare questa carta dalla tua mano e pagare il suo costo di unione. Se lo fai, aggiungi l\'effetto di questa carta a quella magia.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo - Arcano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'845e6d60-5af2-46e8-8df5-a461a4f78186\', \'multiverseId\': 105415}, \'multiverseid\': 105415}, {\'name\': \'常在精神\', \'text\': \'（マナ・コストの無い呪文はプレイできない。）\\nカードを１枚引く。\\n常在精神は青である。\\n連繋（秘儀） {1}{U}（あなたが秘儀呪文をプレイするに際し、あなたはこのカードを手札から公開して、連繋コストを支払ってもよい。 そうした場合、このカードの効果をその呪文に加える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6918da51-47dc-41aa-8bda-85c334b27821\', \'multiverseId\': 105580}, \'multiverseid\': 105580}, {\'name\': \'Mente Eterna\', \'text\': \'(As mágicas sem custo de mana não podem ser jogadas.)\\nCompre um card.\\nMente Eterna é azul.\\nUnir em Arcana {1}{U} (Conforme jogar uma mágica Arcana, você pode revelar este card de sua mão e pagar o seu custo de união. Se o fizer, adicione os efeitos deste card àquela mágica.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea - Arcana\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd433db4-8c95-490a-b1eb-61526967d290\', \'multiverseId\': 105745}, \'multiverseid\': 105745}, {\'name\': \'永铭心間\', \'text\': \'（咒语没有法术力费用就不能使用）\\n抓一张牌。\\n永铭心間是蓝色。\\n通联古咒{1}{U}（于你使用古咒咒语时，你可以从你手上展示此牌，并支付其通联费用。 若你如此作，则将此牌的效应加入该咒语中。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间～古咒\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'811ff444-1289-4809-a771-2964f5c22e74\', \'multiverseId\': 104920}, \'multiverseid\': 104920}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eulen-Netsuke aus Ebenholz\', \'text\': \'Falls zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments eines deiner Gegner dieser Spieler sieben oder mehr Karten auf der Hand hat, fügt ihm der Eulen-Netsuke aus Ebenholz 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Eulen verdunkelten den Himmel während des Kami-Kriegs, Botschafter von dunklen Zeiten, die kommen würden."\\n—Die Geschichte von Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105243&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'914fd705-ce85-47b1-aeb8-894b57eb4980\', \'multiverseId\': 105243}, \'multiverseid\': 105243}, {\'name\': \'Netsuke de búho de ébano\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada oponente, si ese jugador tiene siete o más cartas en la mano, el Netsuke de búho de ébano le hace 4 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los búhos llenaron los cielos durante la guerra con los kami, heraldos de tiempos oscuros que vendrían."\\n—La historia de Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4f6fa57-a39a-40eb-a242-d7fbaa8c6161\', \'multiverseId\': 105903}, \'multiverseid\': 105903}, {\'name\': \'Netsuke de hibou en ébène\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque adversaire, si ce joueur a au moins sept cartes en main, le Netsuke de hibou en ébène lui inflige 4 blessures.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Pendant la Guerre des kami, les hiboux, oiseaux de mauvais augures, emplissèrent le ciel. »\\n—L\'histoire de Kamigawa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105078&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa11123-4a8a-463a-8314-508838143baf\', \'multiverseId\': 105078}, \'multiverseid\': 105078}, {\'name\': "Netsuke Gufo d\'Ebano", \'text\': "All\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni avversario, se quel giocatore ha almeno sette carte in mano, Netsuke Gufo d\'Ebano gli infligge 4 danni.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Durante la Guerra dei Kami i gufi popolavano i cieli, annunciando in questo modo l\\\'arrivo di tempi oscuri."\\n—La Storia di Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8097e369-b069-40ea-ba63-7868936ea0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 105408}, \'multiverseid\': 105408}, {\'name\': \'黒檀の梟の根付\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーの手札のカードが７枚以上である場合、黒檀の梟の根付はそのプレイヤーに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'神の乱の最中、梟が空を埋め、暗黒の時が来ることの先触れとなった。\\n――神河史書\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b2f186e-f47b-4a47-af9e-4b2d0bd82487\', \'multiverseId\': 105573}, \'multiverseid\': 105573}, {\'name\': \'Netsuke de Coruja de Ébano\', \'text\': \'No início da manutenção de cada oponente, se aquele jogador tem sete ou mais cards em sua mão, Netsuke de Coruja de Ébano causa 4 pontos de dano a ele.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Durante a Guerra dos Kamis, as corujas enchiam os céus, qual arautos de tempos mais sombrios que virão."\\n— A História de Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'413a341b-6d63-47de-bae2-c7c668cbb9d5\', \'multiverseId\': 105738}, \'multiverseid\': 105738}, {\'name\': \'黑檀枭吊饰\', \'text\': \'在每位对手的维持开始时，若该牌手的手牌有七张或更多，则夜枭吊饰对他造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「逆神之战时，总有许多夜枭盘旋天空，好似要将时代引领至更黑暗的境地。」\\n～神河通史\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a658574-907b-4fc2-a32c-75b71a47cb8a\', \'multiverseId\': 104913}, \'multiverseid\': 104913}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ewige Herrschaft\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche die Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl nach einem Artefakt, einer Kreatur, einer Verzauberung oder einem Land. Bringe diese Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Dieser Spieler mischt dann seine Bibliothek. Episch (Für den Rest des Spiels kannst du keine Zaubersprüche spielen. Kopiere zu Beginn jedes deiner Versorgungssegmente diesen Zauberspruch außer seiner epischen Fähigkeit. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105249&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b84118-d0d9-4e3d-9520-0f1708c8bb9d\', \'multiverseId\': 105249}, \'multiverseid\': 105249}, {\'name\': \'Dominio eterno\', \'text\': \'Busca una carta de artefacto, criatura, encantamiento o tierra en la biblioteca del oponente objetivo. Pon esa carta en juego bajo tu control. Luego ese jugador baraja su biblioteca. Épico (No puedes jugar hechizos por el resto del juego. Al comienzo de cada uno de tus mantenimientos, copia este hechizo excepto por su habilidad épica. Puedes elegir un nuevo objetivo para la copia.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a1c42a5-9b20-4dc6-ac22-670489673b07\', \'multiverseId\': 105909}, \'multiverseid\': 105909}, {\'name\': \'Domination éternelle\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans la bibliothèque de l\'adversaire ciblé une carte d\'artefact, de créature, d\'enchantement ou de terrain. Mettez en jeu cette carte, sous votre contrôle. Ce joueur mélange ensuite sa bibliothèque. Épique (Pour le restant de la partie, vous ne pouvez pas jouer de sorts. Au début de chacun de vos entretiens, copiez ce sort à l\'exception de sa capacité d\'épique. Vous pouvez choisir une nouvelle cible pour cette copie.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ace27a7d-9b3d-4b6e-89c7-d49ec2712a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 105084}, \'multiverseid\': 105084}, {\'name\': \'Dominio Eterno\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il grimorio di un avversario bersaglio e scegli una carta artefatto, creatura, incantesimo o terra. Metti in gioco quella carta sotto il tuo controllo. Poi quel giocatore rimescola il proprio grimorio. Epopea (Per il resto della partita, non puoi giocare magie. All\'inizio di ogni tuo mantenimento, copia questa magia tranne la sua abilità epopea. Puoi scegliere un nuovo bersaglio per la copia.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d61abb-6d84-4a58-8de9-7c388da83960\', \'multiverseId\': 105414}, \'multiverseid\': 105414}, {\'name\': \'永遠の統制\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーからアーティファクト・カード１枚かクリーチャー・カード１枚かエンチャント・カード１枚か土地カード１枚を探す。 そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で場に出す。 その後、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーを切り直す。 歴伝 （残りのゲームの間、あなたは呪文をプレイできない。 あなたの各アップキープの開始時に、この呪文を歴伝能力を除いてコピーする。 あなたはコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28f6f3e9-5dc9-4a3d-a34d-c51add7c0fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 105579}, \'multiverseid\': 105579}, {\'name\': \'Soberania Eterna\', \'text\': \'Procure no grimório do oponente alvo por um card de artefato, criatura, encantamento ou terreno. Coloque aquele card em jogo sob o seu controle. Depois, aquele jogador embaralha seu próprio grimório. Épica (Você não pode jogar mágicas pelo resto do duelo. No início de cada uma de suas manutenções, copie esta mágica menos sua habilidade épica. Você pode escolher um novo alvo para a cópia.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7661db6-e6fd-4eee-9a73-94d3e62bfc2b\', \'multiverseId\': 105744}, \'multiverseid\': 105744}, {\'name\': \'不朽霸权\', \'text\': \'从目标对手的牌库中搜寻一张神器，生物，结界，或地牌， 并将该牌在你的操控下放置进场。 然后该牌手将其牌库洗牌。 历传（这盘游戏结束之前，你不能使用咒语。 在你每回合的维持开始时，复制此咒语，但不包含其历传异能。 你可以为该复制选择新的目标。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deda3790-d647-4b27-a39b-3ea4281f6860\', \'multiverseId\': 104919}, \'multiverseid\': 104919}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exil in Dunkelheit\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert eine Kreatur mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger.\\nFalls du zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments mehr Karten als jeder Gegner auf der Hand hast, kannst du das Exil in Dunkelheit aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105251&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0f167c9-09f1-4e9e-bbfd-eaeb99ec68dc\', \'multiverseId\': 105251}, \'multiverseid\': 105251}, {\'name\': \'Exilio a la oscuridad\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo sacrifica una criatura con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si tienes más cartas en tu mano que cada oponente, puedes regresar el Exilio a la oscuridad de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60842837-5df9-4419-9f9d-4d1f15bc56b2\', \'multiverseId\': 105911}, \'multiverseid\': 105911}, {\'name\': \'Exil dans les ténèbres\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé sacrifie une créature dont le coût converti de mana est de 3 ou moins.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous avez plus de cartes en main que chaque adversaire, vous pouvez renvoyer l\'Exil dans les ténèbres depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105086&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'873513d9-ab2b-40c1-bd59-493b420186da\', \'multiverseId\': 105086}, \'multiverseid\': 105086}, {\'name\': \'Esilio nelle Tenebre\', \'text\': "Il giocatore bersaglio sacrifica una creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se hai in mano più carte di ogni avversario, puoi riprendere in mano l\'Esilio nelle Tenebre dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9dcb42d-7484-4042-aea7-60c58f4ab7e1\', \'multiverseId\': 105416}, \'multiverseid\': 105416}, {\'name\': \'闇への流刑\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの手札のカードの枚数が各対戦相手よりも多い場合、あなたは闇への流刑をあなたの墓地から手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'835c44a9-dbda-489a-9732-e5d643717b19\', \'multiverseId\': 105581}, \'multiverseid\': 105581}, {\'name\': \'Exílio na Escuridão\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo sacrifica uma criatura com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual a 3.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, se você tiver mais cards em sua mão do que cada oponente, você pode devolver Exílio na Escuridão de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2fb7771-9966-429b-9e14-eab731f16d87\', \'multiverseId\': 105746}, \'multiverseid\': 105746}, {\'name\': \'逐入黯界\', \'text\': \'目标牌手牺牲一个总法术力费用等于或小于3的生物。\\n在你的维持开始时，若你的手牌比每位对手都多，你可以将逐入黯界从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8573515d-420d-4e00-bada-b2b24f349e10\', \'multiverseId\': 104921}, \'multiverseid\': 104921}]', '[{\'name\': \'Farnwedel-Kami\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Geist oder einen arkanen Zauber spielst, regeneriere den Farnwedel-Kami.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie ein Rätsel entfaltet es sich.\\nWie ein grüner Wind tastet es um sich.\\nWie ein plötzliches Schuldgefühl ergreift es."\\n—Schneepelz, Kitsune-Dichter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105253&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0342c24-a717-463e-9aca-d000161ddf08\', \'multiverseId\': 105253}, \'multiverseid\': 105253}, {\'name\': \'Kami hoja de helecho\', \'text\': \'Siempre que juegues un hechizo arcano o de Espíritu, regenera el Kami hoja de helecho.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Como un acertijo, se descubre.\\nComo un viento verde, se estira.\\nComo una culpa repentina, atrapa."\\n—Pelaje-nevado, poeta kitsune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6405ed56-e746-4205-8ae1-b7dba5b44feb\', \'multiverseId\': 105913}, \'multiverseid\': 105913}, {\'name\': \'Kami de crosse\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous jouez un sort d\'esprit ou d\'arcane, régénérez le Kami de crosse.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "« Il se déroule comme une énigme.\\nIl fouette comme un vent d\'émeraude.\\nIl enserre comme la culpabilité. »\\n—Fourrure-de-neige, poète kitsune", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105088&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed2b34d4-6ad0-409d-b3e6-7d2a18fee770\', \'multiverseId\': 105088}, \'multiverseid\': 105088}, {\'name\': \'Kami Testa-di-Violino\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta giochi una magia Spirito o Arcano, rigenera il Kami Testa-di-Violino\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Come un indovinello, si dipana.\\nCome un vento verde, ti sfiora.\\nCome un rimorso improvviso, ti stritola."\\n—Pelo-di-Neve, poeta kitsune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc185b93-8dda-4212-9583-5150a90ca601\', \'multiverseId\': 105418}, \'multiverseid\': 105418}, {\'name\': \'蕨の神\', \'text\': \'あなたがスピリット呪文か秘儀呪文をプレイするたび、蕨の神を再生する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'難なる謎の如く、そは解れ\\n緑なる風の如く、そは届き\\n突なる罪の如く、そは掴む\\n――狐の詩人、雪毛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d6cf17-c365-448c-9aa7-dbacdb2d66e5\', \'multiverseId\': 105583}, \'multiverseid\': 105583}, {\'name\': \'Kami Fronde de Samambaia\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você jogar uma mágica Arcana ou de Espírito, regenera Kami Fronde de Samambaia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Desenreda-se como um enigma.\\nEspalha-se como um vento fresco.\\nApodera-se como uma culpa repentina."\\n— Pêlo de Neve, poeta kitsune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaaba593-ead0-4c84-95af-039e66826f06\', \'multiverseId\': 105748}, \'multiverseid\': 105748}, {\'name\': \'蕨芽神\', \'text\': \'每当你使用精怪或古咒咒语时，重生蕨芽神。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「如谜团松解，\\n像轻风探寻，\\n似恶念紧攫。」\\n～狐诗人雪毛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9ed6c54-bfbf-44cf-ab83-5cd1c00fb7c4\', \'multiverseId\': 104923}, \'multiverseid\': 104923}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flüchtende Serow-Gazellen\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nBringe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine grüne Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6e728b-3b21-41b1-8679-1b90dbf16352\', \'multiverseId\': 105366}, \'multiverseid\': 105366}, {\'name\': \'Cabras en estampida\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, regresa una criatura verde que controles a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=106026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e373269a-12af-4e52-aad8-6edc18610d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 106026}, \'multiverseid\': 106026}, {\'name\': \'Ruée de serows\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nAu début de votre entretien, renvoyez une créature verte que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105201&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0750ae8-a4b7-43a9-a6f7-c690e7a8b499\', \'multiverseId\': 105201}, \'multiverseid\': 105201}, {\'name\': \'Carica di Capricorni\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, il proprietario riprende in mano una creatura verde che tu controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura - Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f0d6e5-fea4-4f08-a1aa-4afb8e2cff6f\', \'multiverseId\': 105531}, \'multiverseid\': 105531}, {\'name\': \'暴走する氈鹿\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがコントロールする緑のクリーチャー１体をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223d026f-b67e-45b3-8bd9-85fa9d41a7f5\', \'multiverseId\': 105696}, \'multiverseid\': 105696}, {\'name\': \'Nemorredo Debandado\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, devolva uma criatura verde que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'055c920c-13c6-4e43-a391-ba400a0e9c51\', \'multiverseId\': 105861}, \'multiverseid\': 105861}, {\'name\': \'狂奔的毡鹿\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n在你的维持开始时，将一个由你操控的绿色生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f57c55e5-b921-4b21-ac2e-d7dcd504f893\', \'multiverseId\': 105036}, \'multiverseid\': 105036}]', '[{\'name\': \'Freigebiger Kirin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Geist oder einen arkanen Zauber spielst, kannst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe der umgewandelten Manakosten dieses Zaubers dazuerhalten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur - Kirin, Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst die wohlwollendsten und lebensspendenden Kami beteiligten sich am Krieg gegen die sterbliche Welt, doch ihre Herzen waren schwer und sorgenerfüllt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105222&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'519686ef-9d5c-41ab-b2ea-81fbf039622b\', \'multiverseId\': 105222}, \'multiverseid\': 105222}, {\'name\': \'Kirin dadivoso\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que juegues un hechizo arcano o de Espíritu, puedes ganar vida igual al coste de maná convertido de ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria - Espíritu kirin\', \'flavor\': \'Hasta los más benevolentes y caritativos de los kami se unieron a la guerra contra el mundo mortal, pero con el corazón apesadumbrado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1941ffd7-1a76-49f2-96e5-8923ab86ee75\', \'multiverseId\': 105882}, \'multiverseid\': 105882}, {\'name\': \'Kirin de générosité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous jouez un sort d\'esprit ou d\'arcane, vous pouvez gagner un nombre de points de vie égal au coût converti de mana de ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : kirin et esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Même les kami les plus bénéfiques entrèrent en guerre contre le monde des mortels. Cependant, ils le firent le cœur lourd.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105057&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'481d58e1-a792-4af4-a660-4dfe0e257954\', \'multiverseId\': 105057}, \'multiverseid\': 105057}, {\'name\': \'Kirin Munifico\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta giochi una magia Spirito o Arcano, puoi guadagnare un ammontare di punti vita pari al costo di mana convertito di quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria - Spirito Kirin\', \'flavor\': \'Anche i kami più benevoli e altruisti si unirono alla guerra contro il mondo mortale, sebbene con cuore greve e affranto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3667327-0376-4b53-a505-95e187d5b702\', \'multiverseId\': 105387}, \'multiverseid\': 105387}, {\'name\': \'寛大な麒麟\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがスピリット呪文か秘儀呪文をプレイするたび、あなたはその呪文の点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のライフを得てもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 麒麟・スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'最も慈悲深く生を与える神ですら現し世を襲う戦に参加したが、その心は重く悲しみに満ちていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bbc6d90-ac01-4076-b478-178cc7fc7bee\', \'multiverseId\': 105552}, \'multiverseid\': 105552}, {\'name\': \'Kirin Generoso\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você jogar uma mágica Arcana ou de Espírito, você pode ganhar uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao custo de mana convertido daquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária - Espírito Kirin\', \'flavor\': \'Mesmos os kamis mais benevolentes e inspiradores juntaram-se à guerra contra o mundo mortal, mas somente com os corações pesados e desolados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b867c9e-d91c-4902-b6b0-8a7a4019f550\', \'multiverseId\': 105717}, \'multiverseid\': 105717}, {\'name\': \'丰足麒麟\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你使用精怪或古咒咒语时，你可以获得与该牌之总法术力费用等量的生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～麒麟／精怪\', \'flavor\': \'就连最慈悲为怀的神明都投身战场与实界为敌，但哀痛使他们的心沉重无比。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14682bd2-dcfc-476e-8b34-2c4c9350fa82\', \'multiverseId\': 104892}, \'multiverseid\': 104892}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkenfänger\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nBringe am Ende des Zuges Funkenfänger auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Durch den Riss im Schleier quollen Hunderte geringere Kami und verbreiteten sich über das Schlachtfeld wie die Glut eines zerstörten Lagerfeuers. Dann verschwanden Sie plötzlich."Die Großen Schlachten von Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105262&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb84b37-7ea1-471f-82d3-d1c640269712\', \'multiverseId\': 105262}, \'multiverseid\': 105262}, {\'name\': \'Colmillo reluciente\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nAl final del turno, regresa el Colmillo reluciente a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Por una rasgadura en el velo entraron cientos de kami menores, atravesando rápidamente el campo de batalla como brasas de un fuego esparcido. Luego desaparecieron."Grandes batallas de Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee76b8e3-faaa-4f15-b769-0930e0e78f20\', \'multiverseId\': 105922}, \'multiverseid\': 105922}, {\'name\': \'Scintillecroc\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nÀ la fin du tour, renvoyez le Scintillecroc dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "« Des centaines de kami mineurs se déversèrent de la déchirure du voile, tombant sur le champ de bataille tels les braises d\'un feu de camp piétiné. Puis ils disparurent. »Grandes batailles de Kamigawa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'871460ea-79b1-463a-a1fc-357f540b0ab8\', \'multiverseId\': 105097}, \'multiverseid\': 105097}, {\'name\': \'Brillafauci\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nAlla fine del turno, il proprietario riprende in mano Brillafauci.\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Attraverso lo strappo nel velo defluirono centinaia di kami minori, che si riversarono sul campo di battaglia come le scintille di un falò preso a calci. Poi, subito dopo sparirono."Le Grandi Battaglie di Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffcf7954-95e8-45aa-af28-cdb596790319\', \'multiverseId\': 105427}, \'multiverseid\': 105427}, {\'name\': \'閃き牙\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nターン終了時に、閃き牙をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'帷の裂け目から卑しき神が何百と戦場に飛び出してきた。その様は、焚き火を蹴飛ばしたときに巻き上がる火の粉のようだった。 そして、彼らは消えてしまった。――神河大戦記\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4daf8028-4323-46db-8f7b-730396cf4a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 105592}, \'multiverseid\': 105592}, {\'name\': \'Presa Brilhante\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nNo final do turno, devolva Presa Brilhante para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Através do rasgo no véu verteram centenas de kamis menores, investindo sobre o campo de batalha como as brasas de uma fogueira que foi chutada. E depois, eles desapareceram." As Grandes Batalhas de Kamigawa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4676a62b-13f2-4c9e-8919-a1e791151987\', \'multiverseId\': 105757}, \'multiverseid\': 105757}, {\'name\': \'闪牙\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n在回合结束时，将闪牙移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「数以百计的低等神明从帘幕裂缝涌出，如星火般席卷战场；顷刻间消失无踪。」 ～神河战记\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7f898f6-c196-465e-9aed-eed9dfc9c6d3\', \'multiverseId\': 104932}, \'multiverseid\': 104932}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fußstapfen der Goryo\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Opfere diese Kreatur am Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei - Arkan\', \'flavor\': \'Im Fall von gewaltsamen Toden boten die Kami eine Gelegenheit zur Rache, falls der Verstorbene den eindringenden Kami seinen Körper als Hülle zur Verfügung stellte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105254&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4abae256-4e97-4011-8e56-814bb6a00fd3\', \'multiverseId\': 105254}, \'multiverseid\': 105254}, {\'name\': \'Huellas de los Goryo\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al juego. Sacrifica esa criatura al final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro - Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'En los casos de muertes violentas, los kami ofrecían una oportunidad de venganza si el caído entregaba su cuerpo como huésped a los kami invasores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c4e867-70d5-4b1e-ad4a-d0d55ee39b5d\', \'multiverseId\': 105914}, \'multiverseid\': 105914}, {\'name\': \'Bruits de pas du goryo\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez en jeu la carte de créature ciblée de votre cimetière. Sacrifiez cette créature à la fin du tour.\', \'type\': \'Rituel : arcane\', \'flavor\': "En cas de mort violente, les kami offraient aux décédés la possibilité de se venger. Il suffisait pour cela qu\'ils fassent don de leurs corps afin d\'abriter un kami.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105089&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a38f148-3fe6-4195-98fc-834a3af0bcf4\', \'multiverseId\': 105089}, \'multiverseid\': 105089}, {\'name\': \'Passi del Goryo\', \'text\': \'Rimetti in gioco una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Sacrifica quella creatura alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria - Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'Nel caso di morti violente, i kami offrivano la possibilità di una vendetta se il deceduto offriva il proprio cadavere come ospite per le forze di invasione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09cb0de6-66ef-4b1e-902f-a81c820b9be7\', \'multiverseId\': 105419}, \'multiverseid\': 105419}, {\'name\': \'御霊の足跡\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを場に出す。 ターン終了時に、そのクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': \'突然の死を迎えた場合、神はその亡骸を侵略する神に差し出すことで復讐の機会を与える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'630412f2-4eeb-4d07-840d-0376ebfd8847\', \'multiverseId\': 105584}, \'multiverseid\': 105584}, {\'name\': \'Passos de Goryo\', \'text\': \'Devolve para o jogo o card alvo de criatura de seu cemitério. Sacrifique aquela criatura no final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço - Arcana\', \'flavor\': \'No caso de mortes violentas, os kamis ofereciam uma chance de vingança se o morto oferecesse seu corpo como um hospedeiro para o kami invasor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5a2f98b-7d6d-4df2-b9a5-bf462877ec80\', \'multiverseId\': 105749}, \'multiverseid\': 105749}, {\'name\': \'怨灵足音\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回场上。 在回合结束时将之牺牲。\', \'type\': \'法术～古咒\', \'flavor\': \'暴卒生灵若愿献出自身亡骸为神军所用，神明便能遂其复仇遗愿。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b5fbbf3-9ec6-46ff-9c52-1591166ce88a\', \'multiverseId\': 104924}, \'multiverseid\': 104924}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefangene Flamme\', \'text\': \'{R}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Tötet dein Essen und brät es gleichzeitig gar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105225&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2402b65-3d72-449b-83e2-3491d22a7d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 105225}, \'multiverseid\': 105225}, {\'name\': \'Llama cautiva\', \'text\': \'{R}: La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Mata y cocina tu comida en un único y sencillo golpe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c6b12cd-50bf-4bfa-a938-f3e9561167c8\', \'multiverseId\': 105885}, \'multiverseid\': 105885}, {\'name\': \'Flamme captive\', \'text\': "{R} : La créature ciblée gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Elle tue et elle cuit votre nourriture en même temps. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105060&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e19ae44-8bf9-445b-b3fc-9c0a01d9d5ba\', \'multiverseId\': 105060}, \'multiverseid\': 105060}, {\'name\': \'Fiamma Prigioniera\', \'text\': \'{R}: La creatura bersaglio prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Uccide e cucina le prede per te in un colpo solo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7af186e4-1ae3-4032-a8f4-2309958b98a1\', \'multiverseId\': 105390}, \'multiverseid\': 105390}, {\'name\': \'捕らわれの炎\', \'text\': \'{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント（場）\', \'flavor\': \'殺して料理にするまでたった一手間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebf4d611-3bbc-4f0a-8c9d-712541034020\', \'multiverseId\': 105555}, \'multiverseid\': 105555}, {\'name\': \'Chama Cativa\', \'text\': \'{R}: A criatura alvo recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Mata e cozinha tua comida a um só tempo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb075759-27cf-4d84-9964-f981b669ca37\', \'multiverseId\': 105720}, \'multiverseid\': 105720}, {\'name\': \'聚焰附刃\', \'text\': \'{R}：目标生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「一刀就熟，方便得很。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=104895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4fa8249-c37b-4f09-8df0-bca685a829ab\', \'multiverseId\': 104895}, \'multiverseid\': 104895}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geheimnisbewahrer\', \'text\': \'Solange du mehr Karten als jeder Gegner auf der Hand hast, erhält der Geheimnisbewahrer +2/+2 und Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur - Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Er ist all das, was die Menschheit nicht wissen soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105346&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a821554-c3d3-4634-a553-60cf3febdf69\', \'multiverseId\': 105346}, \'multiverseid\': 105346}, {\'name\': \'Guardasecretos\', \'text\': \'Mientras tengas más cartas en tu mano que cada oponente, el Guardasecretos obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Es todas las cosas que la humanidad no debería conocer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=106006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dd5d409-f1d2-4979-b461-353b461a6c23\', \'multiverseId\': 106006}, \'multiverseid\': 106006}, {\'name\': \'Gardien des secrets\', \'text\': \'Tant que vous avez plus de cartes en main que chaque adversaire, le Gardien des secrets gagne +2/+2 et a le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "Il y a des choses que l\'humanité n\'est pas censée connaître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105181&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3f00d5f-3c13-4586-80aa-be1cbdd81127\', \'multiverseId\': 105181}, \'multiverseid\': 105181}, {\'name\': \'Guardasegreti\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che hai in mano più carte di ogni avversario, il Guardasegreti prende +2/+2 e ha volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura - Spirito\', \'flavor\': "È tutto ciò che l\'umanità non avrebbe mai dovuto conoscere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4f16e0-3bc1-4a52-bc41-bd00ad67eb7a\', \'multiverseId\': 105511}, \'multiverseid\': 105511}, {\'name\': \'秘守り\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札のカードの枚数が各対戦相手よりも多いかぎり、秘守りは+2/+2の修整を受けるとともに飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'人間性の中にも知るべきでないものがあるということだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d9a2c63-071a-48c9-9787-038dab2dbedf\', \'multiverseId\': 105676}, \'multiverseid\': 105676}, {\'name\': \'Guardião dos Segredos\', \'text\': \'Desde que você tenha mais cards em sua mão do que cada oponente, Guardião Secreto recebe +2/+2 e tem a habilidade de voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura - Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'É tudo o que a humanidade não podia saber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=105841&type=card